<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOS" style="id">JOS</book>
  <para style="h">Josué</para>
  <para style="toc1">JOSUÉ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Josué</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jos</para>
  <para style="mt1">JOSUÉ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOS 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 1:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke apre lanmò Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, ke SENYÈ a te pale avèk Josué, fis a Nun nan, sèvitè Moïse la. Li te di: <verse eid="JOS 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 1:2"/>“Moïse, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:7">Nonb 12:7</ref></char></note>sèvitè Mwen an, gen tan mouri. Pou sa, leve, travèse Jourdain sila a, ou menm avèk tout pèp sa a, nan peyi ke Mwen ap bay a yo menm, a fis Israël yo.<verse eid="JOS 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 1:3"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:24">Det 11:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Chak kote ke pla pye ou va pile, Mwen ap ba ou li, jis jan ke Mwen te pale a Moïse la. <verse eid="JOS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 1:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:8">Jen 15:8</ref></char></note>Soti nan dezè a ak Liban sila a, menm jis rive nan gran rivyè a, Rivyè Lefrat la, tout peyi Etyen an, jis rive nan Gran Lamè a vè solèy kouche a va teritwa pa nou. <verse eid="JOS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 1:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:24">Det 7:24</ref></char></note>Nanpwen moun ki kapab kanpe devan ou pandan tout jou lavi ou. Menm jan ke Mwen te avèk Moïse la, Mwen va avèk ou. Mwen p ap fè bak ni abandone ou. <verse eid="JOS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 1:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:6-23">Det 31:6-23</ref></char></note>Kenbe fèm e pran kouraj, paske ou va bay pèp sa a posesyon a peyi ke Mwen te sèmante a zansèt yo pou M ba yo a.<verse eid="JOS 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 1:7"/>“Sèlman rete fò avèk anpil kouraj; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:32">Det 5:32</ref></char></note>fè atansyon pou fè tout sa lalwa ke Moïse, sèvitè Mwen an, te kòmande ou fè a. Pa vire ni adwat ni agoch, pou ou kapab reyisi nenpòt kote ke ou ale.<verse eid="JOS 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 1:8"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 31:24">Det 31:24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Liv lalwa sila a pa pou janm kite bouch ou, men ou va reflechi sou li lajounen kon lannwit, pou ou kapab fè atansyon pou fè tout sa ki ekri ladann; paske konsa, ou va fè chemen ou yo pwospere e konsa, yo va byen reyisi.<verse eid="JOS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 1:9"/>“Èske mwen pa t kòmande ou? Kenbe fèm e pran kouraj! <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:8">Det 31:8</ref></char></note>Pa tranble ni enkyete, paske SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, avèk ou nenpòt kote ou ale.”<verse eid="JOS 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 1:10"/>Konsa, Josué te kòmande ofisye pèp yo. Li te di: <verse eid="JOS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 1:11"/>“Pase nan mitan kan an e kòmande pèp la pou di yo: ‘Prepare pwovizyon nou. Paske nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:2">Jos 3:2</ref></char></note>twa jou, nou va travèse Jourdain sila a, pou antre pran peyi ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, ap bannou pou posede a.’”<verse eid="JOS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 1:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 32:20-22">Nonb 32:20-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A Ribenit yo avèk Gadit yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé a, Josué te di: <verse eid="JOS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 1:13"/>“Sonje pawòl ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te kòmande nou, lè l te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:18-20">Det 3:18-20</ref></char></note>‘SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, ap bannou repo, e Li va bannou peyi sa a.<verse eid="JOS 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 1:14"/>“‘Madanm nou yo, pitit nou yo ak bèt nou yo va rete nan peyi ke Moïse te bannou lòtbò Jourdain an; men nou va travèse devan frè nou yo, prepare an lòd batay la, tout sòlda vanyan nou yo e ou va bay yo soutyen, <verse eid="JOS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 1:15"/>jiskaske SENYÈ a bay frè nou yo repo, tankou nou, epi yo menm tou, yo posede peyi ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, ap bay yo a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:4">Jos 22:4</ref></char></note>Epi nan lè sa a, nou va retounen nan pwòp teren pa nou an, e posede sa ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te bannou lòtbò Jourdain an, vè solèy leve a.’”<verse eid="JOS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 1:16"/>Yo te reponn Josué e te di: “Tout sa ke ou te kòmande nou, nou va fè l, epi nenpòt kote ke ou voye nou, nou va ale. <verse eid="JOS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 1:17"/>Jis jan ke nou te obeyi Moïse nan tout bagay la, konsa nou va obeyi ou. Sèlman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5-9">Jos 1:5-9</ref></char></note>ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, kapab avèk ou tankou Li te avèk Moïse la. <verse eid="JOS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 1:18"/>Nenpòt moun ki fè rebèl kont lòd ou, e ki pa obeyi pawòl ou yo nan tout sa ou kòmande li fè yo, li va vin mete a lanmò. Sèlman, kenbe fèm e pran kouraj.”<verse eid="JOS 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOS 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 2:1"/>Epi Josué, fis a Nun nan, te voye de mesye kòm espyon an sekrè soti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1">Nonb 25:1</ref></char></note>Sittim. Li te di: “Ale gade peyi a, sitou Jéricho.” Epi yo te ale e te antre lakay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:31">Eb 11:31</ref></char></note>yon pwostitiye ki te rele Rahab. Yo te dòmi la.<verse eid="JOS 2:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 2:2"/>Sa te pale a wa Jéricho a. Yo te di: “Gade byen, de mesye ki sòti nan fis Israël yo te vini isit la lannwit lan pou fè espyon nan peyi a.” <verse eid="JOS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 2:3"/>Epi wa Jéricho a te voye vè Rahab e te di: “Mete deyò mesye ki te vin kote ou yo, paske yo te vin fè espyon nan peyi a.”<verse eid="JOS 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 2:4"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 17:19">II Sam 17:19</ref></char></note>fanm nan ki te deja pran mesye yo pou kache yo, te di: “Wi, mesye sa yo te vini kote mwen, men mwen pa t konnen kote yo te sòti. <verse eid="JOS 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 2:5"/>Li te vin rive nan lè pou fèmen pòtay yo lè l te fènwa, ke mesye yo sòti deyò. Men mwen pa konnen kote mesye yo te ale. Kouri dèyè yo byen vit! Konsa, ou ka gen tan pran yo.”<verse eid="JOS 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 2:6"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:25">Jc 2:25</ref></char></note>li te vrèman mennen yo anwo galri twati kay la, pou l te kache yo nan pakèt len ke li te mete an lòd sou twati kay la.<verse eid="JOS 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 2:7"/>Konsa, mesye yo te kouri dèyè yo sou wout la pou rive nan lye pou travèse Jourdain an. Depi sila ki t ap pouswiv yo te pati, yo te fèmen pòtay la.<verse eid="JOS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 2:8"/>Alò, avan yo te kouche, fi a te vin kote yo sou twati a. <verse eid="JOS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 2:9"/>Epi li te di mesye yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 20:24">Nonb 20:24</ref></char></note>“Mwen konnen ke SENYÈ a te bannou peyi a, e ke gwo laperèz nou gen tan tonbe sou nou. Tout kouraj abitan peyi a vin fonn e disparèt devan nou. <verse eid="JOS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 2:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Egz 14:21</ref></char></note>Paske nou te tande jan SENYÈ a te fin seche dlo Lamè Wouj devan nou lè nou te sòti an Égypte la, ak sa nou te fè de wa Amoreyen ki te lòtbò Jourdain yo, a Sihon ak Og, ke nou te detwi nèt. <verse eid="JOS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 2:11"/>Lè nou vin tande sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:1">Jos 5:1</ref></char></note>kè nou te fonn. Pa t gen kouraj ki te rete nan okenn moun ankò akoz nou menm, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:39">Det 4:39</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, se Li ki Bondye anwo nan syèl la e anba sou tè a.<verse eid="JOS 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 2:12"/>“Alò, pou sa, souple, sèmante a mwen pa SENYÈ a, paske mwen te aji avèk bon kè anvè nou; ke nou, osi, nou va aji avèk bon kè anvè lakay papa m. Fè mwen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:18-19">Jos 2:18-19</ref></char></note>sèman fidèl, <verse eid="JOS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 2:13"/>pou konsève lavi papa m avèk manman m, frè m avèk sè m yo avèk tout moun ki pou yo, e livre lavi nou sòti nan lanmò.”<verse eid="JOS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 2:14"/>Konsa, mesye yo te di l: “Vi pa nou pou vi pa w si ou pa pale zafè nou; epi li va rive ke lè SENYÈ a bannou peyi a, ke nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:49">Jen 24:49</ref></char></note>aji avèk bon kè, e fidèlman avèk ou.”<verse eid="JOS 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 2:15"/>Konsa, li te fè yo desann nan fenèt la pa yon kòd; paske lakay li a se te sou miray lavil la, kòmsi li t ap viv sou miray la. <verse eid="JOS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 2:16"/>Li te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:25">Jc 2:25</ref></char></note>“Ale nan peyi kolin yo, pou sila k ap kouri dèyè nou yo pa twouve nou. Kache kò nou la pandan twa jou jiskaske sila k ap kouri dèyè nou yo retounen. Epi apre, nou kapab fè wout nou.”<verse eid="JOS 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 2:17"/>Mesye yo te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:8">Jen 24:8</ref></char></note>“Nou p ap responsab sèman ke ou te fè nou fè a, <verse eid="JOS 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 2:18"/>amwenske lè nou antre nan peyi a, ou mare kòd fisèl wouj sa a nan fenèt kote ou te fè nou desann nan. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:12">Jos 2:12</ref></char></note>rasanble ou menm nan kay la avèk papa ou ak manman ou, frè ou yo ak tout manm lakay papa ou yo. <verse eid="JOS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 2:19"/>Li va rive ke nenpòt moun ki ale deyò pòt lakay ou pou antre nan lari a, san li va sou pwòp tèt li e nou va lib de sèman an. Men nenpòt moun ki avèk ou nan kay la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mat 27:25</ref></char></note>san pa li va sou tèt nou si yon moun men mete sou li. <verse eid="JOS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 2:20"/>Men si ou pale zafè sa a; alò, nou va vin lib de sèman ke ou te fè nou fè a.”<verse eid="JOS 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 2:21"/>Li te di: “Selon pawòl nou, ke sa vin fèt konsa.” Epi li te voye yo ale. Yo te pati, epi li te mare kòd wouj la nan fenèt la.<verse eid="JOS 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 2:22"/>Yo te pati pou te rive nan peyi kolin yo, e te rete la pandan twa jou jiskaske sila ki t ap pouswiv yo te retounen. Alò, moun ki t ap swiv yo te chache toupatou akote chemen an, men yo pa t twouve yo.<verse eid="JOS 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 2:23"/>Konsa, de mesye sa yo te desann peyi kolin yo pou te travèse rive kote Josué, fis a Nun nan. Yo te pale li tout sa ki te rive yo. <verse eid="JOS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 2:24"/>Yo te di Josué: “Anverite, SENYÈ a te bannou tout peyi a nan men nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:9">Jos 2:9</ref></char></note>Anplis, kè tout abitan peyi a tap fonn e disparèt devan nou.”<verse eid="JOS 2:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOS 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 3:1"/>Josué te leve bonè nan maten. Li menm avèk tout fis Israël yo te kite <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:1">Jos 2:1</ref></char></note>Sittim pou te rive nan Jourdain an, e yo te fè kan avan yo te travèse.<verse eid="JOS 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 3:2"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 1:11">Jos 1:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan fen twa jou, ofisye yo te pase nan mitan kan an. <verse eid="JOS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 3:3"/>Yo te kòmande pèp la e te di: “Lè nou wè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:9">Det 31:9</ref></char></note>lach akò SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, avèk prèt Levit yo k ap pote li, alò, nou va sòti nan plas nou pou swiv li. <verse eid="JOS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 3:4"/>Sepandan, va gen antre nou ak li yon distans anviwon de mil koude (3,000 pye) pa mezi. Pa vin pi prè li, pou nou kapab konnen chemen ke nap pran, paske nou pa t janm fè wout sa a avan.”<verse eid="JOS 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 3:5"/>Konsa, Josué te di a pèp la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:10-11">Egz 19:10-11</ref></char></note>“Konsakre tèt nou; paske demen SENYÈ a va fè mèvèy yo nan mitan nou.”<verse eid="JOS 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 3:6"/>Josué te pale avèk prèt yo e te di: “Vin leve lach akò a pou travèse lòtbò a avan pèp la.”<verse eid="JOS 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 3:7"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di a Josué: “Jou sa a, Mwen va kòmanse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:14">Jos 4:14</ref></char></note>egzalte ou nan zye tout Israël la, pou yo kapab konnen ke menm jan ke M te avèk Moïse la, Mwen va avèk ou. <verse eid="JOS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 3:8"/>Anplis, ou va kòmande prèt k ap pote lach akò a e di yo: ‘Lè nou rive arebò dlo yo nan Jourdain an, nou va rete kanpe nan dlo Jourdain an.’”<verse eid="JOS 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 3:9"/>Konsa, Josué te di a fis Israël yo: “Vin la pou koute pawòl a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.” <verse eid="JOS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 3:10"/>Josué te di: “Pa sa nou va konnen ke Bondye vivan an pami nou e ke Li va, anverite, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:2">Egz 33:2</ref></char></note>deplase soti devan nou Kananeyen an, Etyen an, Evyen an, Ferezyen an, Gigazyen an, Amoreyen an ak Jebizyen an. <verse eid="JOS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 3:11"/>Gade byen, lach akò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:11">Job 41:11</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a tout latè a ap travèse devan nou antre nan Jourdain an.<verse eid="JOS 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 3:12"/>“Alò, pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:2">Jos 4:2</ref></char></note>pran pou nou menm douz mesye soti nan tribi Israël la, yon nonm pou chak tribi. <verse eid="JOS 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 3:13"/>Li va rive ke lè pla pye a prèt ki pote lach SENYÈ a, SENYÈ tout latè a, poze nan dlo a Jourdain an, dlo Jourdain an va koupe, e dlo k ap kouri desann soti anwo yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:8">Egz 15:8</ref></char></note>rete fè yon pil.”<verse eid="JOS 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 3:14"/>Pou sa, lè pèp la kite tant pa yo pou travèse Jourdain an avèk prèt k ap pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:8">Sòm 132:8</ref></char></note>lach akò a devan pèp la, <verse eid="JOS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 3:15"/>epi lè sila ki te pote lach la te antre nan Jourdain an, epi depi pye a prèt k ap pote lach la te tanmen fonse bò dlo a; (paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 12:15">I Kwo 12:15</ref></char></note>Jourdain an toujou depase rivaj li yo pandan tout sezon rekòlt la), <verse eid="JOS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 3:16"/>dlo ki t ap kouri desann soti anwo yo te kanpe, e te leve wo fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:13">Jos 3:13</ref></char></note>yon pil, a yon gran distans de la, nan Adam, vil ki akote Tsarthan an; epi dlo sa yo ki t ap kouri desann vè lanmè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:1">Det 1:1</ref></char></note>Araba a, ak Lamè Sale a, te vin koupe nèt. Konsa pèp la te travèse anfas Jéricho.<verse eid="JOS 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 3:17"/>Prèt yo ki t ap pote lach akò SENYÈ a te kanpe fèm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21-29">Egz 14:21-29</ref></char></note>sou tè sèk nan mitan Jourdain an pandan tout Israël t ap travèse sou tè sèk, jiskaske tout nasyon an te fin travèse Jourdain an.<verse eid="JOS 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOS 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 4:1"/>Alò, lè tout nasyon an te fin travèse <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:2">Det 27:2</ref></char></note>Jourdain an, SENYÈ a te pale avèk Josué. Li te di: <verse eid="JOS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 4:2"/>“Pran pou nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:12">Jos 3:12</ref></char></note>douz mesye pami pèp la, yon mesye ki soti nan chak tribi. <verse eid="JOS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 4:3"/>Kòmande yo e di: ‘Ranmase pou kont nou douz wòch soti isit la nan mitan Jourdain an, soti nan plas kote pye prèt la ap kanpe fèm nan. Pote yo janbe avèk nou, e poze yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:20">Jos 4:20</ref></char></note>plas lojman kote nou va dòmi aswè a.’” <verse eid="JOS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 4:4"/>Konsa, Josué te rele douz mesye ke li te chwazi soti nan fis Israël yo, yon mesye nan chak tribi, <verse eid="JOS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 4:5"/>epi Josué te di yo: “Travèse ankò vè lach SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, pou rive nan mitan Jourdain an e nou chak pran yon wòch sou zepòl li, selon nonb a tribi a fis Israël yo. <verse eid="JOS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 4:6"/>Ke sa sèvi kòm yon sign pami nou, jis pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:26">Egz 12:26</ref></char></note>lè pitit nou yo mande pita e di: ‘Kisa wòch sa yo vle di a nou menm’? <verse eid="JOS 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 4:7"/>Alò nou va di yo: ‘Akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:13">Jos 3:13</ref></char></note>dlo Jourdain yo te koupe devan lach akò SENYÈ a. Lè lach la te travèse Jourdain an, dlo Jourdain yo te koupe. Pou sa, wòch sa yo va sèvi kòm yon souvni pou fis Israël yo pou tout tan.’” <verse eid="JOS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 4:8"/>Konsa, fis Israël yo te fè jan Josué te kòmande yo a. Yo te leve pran douz wòch yo nan mitan Jourdain an, jan SENYÈ a te pale a Josué a, selon nonb a tribi a fis Israël yo, epi yo te pote yo janbe avèk yo pou rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:20">Jos 4:20</ref></char></note>plas lojman an e te poze yo la. <verse eid="JOS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 4:9"/>Epi Josué te poze douz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:18">Jen 28:18</ref></char></note>wòch yo nan mitan Jourdain an nan plas kote pye a prèt yo ki te pote lach akò a te kanpe. Yo la, jis jodi a. <verse eid="JOS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 4:10"/>Paske prèt yo ki te pote lach la te kanpe nan mitan Jourdain an jiskaske tout bagay ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Josué pou pale a pèp la te fini, selon tout sa ke Moïse te kòmande Josué yo. Konsa, pèp la te fè vit travèse. <verse eid="JOS 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 4:11"/>Lè tout pèp la te fin travèse, lach SENYÈ a avèk prèt yo te travèse nan prezans a pèp la. <verse eid="JOS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 4:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:17">Nonb 32:17</ref></char></note>Fis Ruben yo ak fis a Gad yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé a te janbe abiye e prepare pou fè lagè devan fis Israël yo, jis jan ke Moïse te pale yo a. <verse eid="JOS 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 4:13"/>Anviwon karant mil mesye, prèt pou batay, te travèse devan SENYÈ a vè plèn dezè a Jéricho a. <verse eid="JOS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 4:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:7">Jos 3:7</ref></char></note>Nan jou sa a, SENYÈ a te egzalte Josué nan zye a tout Israël; jis pou yo genyen l respè avèk lakrent, jis jan ke yo te gen respè avèk lakrent pou Moïse pandan tout jou ke li te viv yo. <verse eid="JOS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 4:15"/>Alò SENYÈ a te di a Josué: <verse eid="JOS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 4:16"/>“Kòmande prèt ki pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:16">Egz 25:16</ref></char></note>lach akò a pou monte kite Jourdain an.” <verse eid="JOS 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 4:17"/>Konsa, Josué te kòmande prèt yo. Li te di: “Monte soti nan Jourdain an.” <verse eid="JOS 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 4:18"/>Li te vin rive ke lè prèt ki te pote lach SENYÈ yo te kite mitan Jourdain an, e pla pye yo te monte sou tè sèk, dlo Jourdain an te retounen nan plas li e te depase rivaj yo kòm avan an. <verse eid="JOS 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 4:19"/>Konsa, pèp la te monte kite Jourdain an nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:3">Det 1:3</ref></char></note>dizyèm jou a premye mwa a, epi yo te fè kan nan Guilgal akote lès Jéricho. <verse eid="JOS 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 4:20"/>Douz wòch sa yo ke yo te pran nan Jourdain an, Josué te monte nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:3-8">Jos 4:3-8</ref></char></note>Guilgal. <verse eid="JOS 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 4:21"/>Li te di a fis Israël yo: “Lè pitit nou yo mande papa yo nan tan k ap vini yo, e di: ‘Kisa wòch sa yo ye?’ <verse eid="JOS 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 4:22"/>Alò, nou va eksplike pitit nou yo pou di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:17">Jos 3:17</ref></char></note> ‘Israël te travèse Jourdain sila a sou tè sèk’. <verse eid="JOS 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 4:23"/>Paske SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, te seche dlo Jourdain yo devan nou jiskaske nou te fin travèse, jis jan ke Li te fè nan Lamè Wouj la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Egz 14:21</ref></char></note>ke Li te seche devan nou jiskaske nou te fin travèse a, <verse eid="JOS 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 4:24"/>pou tout pèp sou latè yo kapab konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:42">I Wa 8:42</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 15:16">Egz 15:16</ref></char></note>men SENYÈ a pwisan, pou nou kapab gen lakrent SENYÈ a pou tout tan.”<verse eid="JOS 4:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOS 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 5:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke lè tout wa Amoreyen ki te lòtbò Jourdain yo vè lwès ak tout wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:29">Nonb 13:29</ref></char></note>Canaran akote lanmè yo, te tande jan SENYÈ a te seche dlo Jourdain an devan fis Israël yo jiskaske yo te travèse, ke kè yo te fonn, e yo pa t gen kouraj nan yo ankò akoz fis Israël yo.<verse eid="JOS 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 5:2"/>Nan tan sa a, SENYÈ a te di a Josué: “Fè pou ou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:25">Egz 4:25</ref></char></note>kouto avèk silèks e sikonsi ankò fis Israël yo pou dezyèm fwa a.” <verse eid="JOS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 5:3"/>Konsa, Josué te fè pou kont li kouto avèk silèks e te sikonsi fis Israël yo nan Gilbreath-Araloth.<verse eid="JOS 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 5:4"/>Men rezon pou sila Josué te sikonsi yo a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:14">Det 2:14</ref></char></note>tout pèp la ki te sòti an Égypte nan gason yo, tout mesye lagè yo, te mouri nan dezè a nan wout lè yo fin kite Égypte. <verse eid="JOS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 5:5"/>Paske tout mesye ki te sòti yo te sikonsi, men tout mesye ki te fèt nan dezè a nan wout la pandan yo sòti an Égypte la pa t ankò sikonsi.<verse eid="JOS 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 5:6"/>Paske fis Israël yo te mache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:7-14">Det 2:7-14</ref></char></note>karantan nan dezè a, jis tout nasyon an, mesye lagè ki te sòti an Égypte yo, te peri akoz yo pa t koute vwa SENYÈ a, a sila SENYÈ a te sèmante ke Li pa t ap kite yo wè peyi ke SENYÈ a te sèmante bay zansèt pa yo pou bannou an, yon peyi ki koule avèk lèt ak siwo myèl.<verse eid="JOS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 5:7"/>Timoun ke Li te vin leve pou ranplase yo, Josué te sikonsi yo. Paske yo pa t sikonsi akoz ke yo pa t sikonsi yo nan wout la. <verse eid="JOS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 5:8"/>Alò, lè yo te fin sikonsi tout nasyon an, yo te rete nan plas yo nan kan an jiskaske yo te fin geri.<verse eid="JOS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 5:9"/>Epi SENYÈ a te di a Josué: “Jodi a, Mwen te woule fè sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 2:8">So 2:8</ref></char></note>wont a Égypte la sou nou menm.” Konsa, jis jodi a, yo rele plas sa a Guilgal.<verse eid="JOS 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 5:10"/>Pandan fis Israël yo te rete Guilgal, yo te obsève Pak la nan lannwit katòzyèm jou nan mwa a nan plèn dezè a Jéricho a.<verse eid="JOS 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 5:11"/>Nan jou apre Pak la, nan menm jou sa a, yo te manje kèk nan pwodwi tè yo, gato san ledven ak sereyal griye. <verse eid="JOS 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 5:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 16:35">Egz 16:35</ref></char></note>Lamàn te sispann nan jou apre yo te manje kèk nan pwodwi tè yo. Konsa, fis Israël yo pa t gen lamàn ankò, men yo te manje nan donn tè Canaran an pandan ane sa a.<verse eid="JOS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 5:13"/>Alò, li te rive ke lè Josué te toupre Jéricho, li te leve zye li anwo e te gade, vwala, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:1-2">Jen 18:1-2</ref></char></note>yon nonm te kanpe anfas li avèk nepe li rale nan men l. Josué te pwoche l, e li te di li: “Èske ou pou nou oswa kont nou?”<verse eid="JOS 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 5:14"/>Li te reponn: “Non; olye de sa, anverite mwen vini koulye a kòm kapitèn a lame SENYÈ a.” Konsa, Josué te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:3">Jen 17:3</ref></char></note>tonbe atè sou figi li. Li te adore l e te di li: “Kisa mèt mwen an gen pou di a sèvitè li?”<verse eid="JOS 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 5:15"/>Kapitèn a lame SENYÈ a te di a Josué: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:5">Egz 3:5</ref></char></note>“Retire sapat ou nan pye ou, paske plas kote ou kanpe a sen.” Epi Josué te fè l.<verse eid="JOS 5:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOS 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 6:1"/>Alò, Jéricho te byen sere pa fis Israël yo. Pèsòn pa t sòti ni antre.<verse eid="JOS 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 6:2"/>SENYÈ a te di a Josué: “Gade, Mwen te livre Jéricho nan men ou, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:24">Det 7:24</ref></char></note>wa li ak gèrye vanyan li yo. <verse eid="JOS 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 6:3"/>Mache antoure vil la avèk tout mesye lagè nou yo pou l tou ansèkle li yon fwa. Ou va fè sa pandan si jou. <verse eid="JOS 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 6:4"/>Anplis, sèt prèt va pote sèt twonpèt fèt ak kòn belye devan lach la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 6:4">“Konsa, nan setyèm jou a, nou va mache antoure vil la sèt fwa e prèt yo va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:9">Lev 25:9</ref></char></note>soufle twonpèt yo. <verse eid="JOS 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 6:5"/>Li va vin rive ke lè yo fè yon gwo son avèk kòn belye a, lè nou tande son twonpèt la, tout pèp la va rele fò avèk yon gwo bri; epi miray vil la va tonbe plat e pèp la va monte, chak moun tou dwat.”<verse eid="JOS 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 6:6"/>Konsa, Josué, fis la a Nun nan, te rele prèt yo. Li te di yo: “Pran lach akò a, e kite sèt prèt yo pote sèt twonpèt yo fèt avèk kòn belye yo devan lach SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="JOS 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 6:7"/>Yo te di a pèp la: “Ale devan, mache antoure vil la e kite mesye ak zam yo ale devan lach SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JOS 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 6:8"/>Li te vin rive ke lè Josué te pale avèk pèp la, sèt prèt ki t ap pote sèt twonpèt a kòn belye yo devan SENYÈ a te avanse, e te soufle twonpèt yo, epi lach akò SENYÈ a te swiv yo. <verse eid="JOS 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 6:9"/>Mesye avèk zam yo te ale devan prèt ki tap soufle twonpèt yo, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:13">Jos 6:13</ref></char></note>gad aryè a te swiv lach la, pandan yo te kontinye ap soufle twonpèt yo.<verse eid="JOS 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 6:10"/>Men Josué te kòmande pèp la e te di: “Nou pa pou rele, ni kite yo tande vwa nou menm. Ni pa kite yon mo sòti nan bouch nou, jis rive jou ke m di nou: ‘Rele fò!’ Alò, nan moman sa a, nou va rele fò!”<verse eid="JOS 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 6:11"/>Konsa, li te fè lach SENYÈ a antoure vil la ansèkle l yon fwa. Konsa, yo te rantre nan kan an, e yo te pase nwit lan la nan kan an.<verse eid="JOS 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 6:12"/>Alò, Josué te leve granmmaten, e prèt yo te leve pran lach SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JOS 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 6:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:4-9">Jos 6:4-9</ref></char></note>Sèt prèt ki te pote sèt twonpèt kòn belye yo devan lach SENYÈ a, te kontinye san rete e te soufle twonpèt yo. Mesye avèk zam yo te ale devan yo, e gad an aryè yo te swiv lach SENYÈ a, pandan yo te kontinye ap soufle twonpèt yo. <verse eid="JOS 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 6:14"/>Konsa, nan dezyèm jou a, yo te mache antoure vil la yon fwa e te retounen nan kan an. Yo te fè konsa pandan si jou.<verse eid="JOS 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 6:15"/>Alò, nan setyèm jou a, yo te leve bonè avan jou, e te mache antoure vil la menm jan an sèt fwa. Sèl nan jou sa a, yo te mache antoure vil la sèt fwa. <verse eid="JOS 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 6:16"/>Nan setyèm fwa a, lè prèt yo te soufle twonpèt yo, Josué te di a pèp la: “Rele fò!” Paske SENYÈ a gen tan bannou vil la.<verse eid="JOS 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 6:17"/>“Vil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:28">Lev 27:28</ref></char></note>va vin dedye anba ve, li menm avèk tout sa ki ladann se pou SENYÈ a. Sèl Rahab, pwostitiye a ak tout moun ki avè l nan kay la va viv, akoz li te kache mesaje ke nou te voye yo.<verse eid="JOS 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 6:18"/>“Men pou nou menm, sèlman kenbe tèt nou apa pou pa fè bagay sa yo ki anba ve pou detwi, pou nou pa anvi yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1">Jos 7:1</ref></char></note>pran kèk bagay ki anba ve a, pou fè kay Israël la vin modi pou gwo pwoblèm vin sou li. <verse eid="JOS 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 6:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:11-23">Nonb 31:11-23</ref></char></note>Men tout ajan avèk lò, zafè an bwonz ak fè, sen a SENYÈ a. Yo va antre nan trezò SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JOS 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 6:20"/>Alò, pèp la te rele fò, prèt yo te soufle twonpèt yo. Lè pèp la te tande son twonpèt la, yo te rele fò avèk yon gwo kri, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:30">Eb 11:30</ref></char></note>miray la te tonbe plat. Epi konsa, pèp la te antre nan vil la, tout mesye toudwat pou yo te pran vil la. <verse eid="JOS 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 6:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:16">Det 20:16</ref></char></note>Yo te detwi tout bagay nan vil la nèt; ni gason, ni fanm, jèn kon granmoun, ni bèf, ni mouton, ni bourik, pa lam nepe.<verse eid="JOS 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 6:22"/>Josué te di a de mesye ki te fè espyonaj peyi yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:12-19">Jos 2:12-19</ref></char></note>“Antre lakay pwostitiye a e mete fanm nan avèk tout sa li genyen deyò, jan nou te pwomèt li a.” <verse eid="JOS 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 6:23"/>Konsa, jennonm ki te espyon yo te antre. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:31">Eb 11:31</ref></char></note>mennen Rahab deyò avèk papa l ak manman l, frè li yo avèk tout sa li te genyen. Anplis, yo te mete deyò tout fanmi li yo e te plase yo deyò kan Israël la.<verse eid="JOS 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 6:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 20:16-18">Det 20:16-18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Yo te brile vil la avèk dife ak tout sa ki ladann. Sèlman ajan avèk lò avèk tout bagay ki te fèt an bwonz ak fè, yo te mete yo nan trezò kay SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JOS 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 6:25"/>Sepandan, Rahab, pwostitiye a, avèk tout kay papa l ak tout sa li te genyen, Josué te konsève yo. Epi li te viv nan mitan Israël jis rive jodi a, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 2:6">Jos 2:6</ref></char></note>li te kache mesaje ke Josué te voye pou fè espyonaj Jéricho yo.<verse eid="JOS 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 6:26"/>Konsa, Josué te pase lòd sèman an nan lè sa a. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:34">I Wa 15:34</ref></char></note>“Modi devan SENYÈ a se sila ki leve pou rebati vil sa a, Jéricho. Avèk pèt premye ne li yo, li va poze fondasyon li; avèk pèt denyè ne li yo, li va monte pòtay li yo.”<verse eid="JOS 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 6:27"/>SENYÈ a te avèk Josué e li te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:1-3">Jos 9:1-3</ref></char></note>byen rekonèt nan tout peyi a.<verse eid="JOS 6:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOS 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 7:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 6:17-19">Jos 6:17-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Men fis Israël yo te aji avèk movèz fwa nan bagay ki te dedye anba ve yo; paske Acan, fis a Carmi a, fis a Zabdi, fis a Zérach, nan tribi Juda a, te pran kèk nan bagay ki te dedye anba ve yo. Pou sa, chalè SENYÈ a te brile kont fis Israël yo.<verse eid="JOS 7:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 7:2"/>Alò, Josué te voye mesye sòti Jéricho yo vè Aï, ki toupre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:12">Jos 18:12</ref></char></note>Beth-Aven an, nan lès a Bethel la. Li te di yo: “Ale monte e fè espyonaj peyi a.” Konsa, mesye yo te monte pou te fè espyonaj Aï.<verse eid="JOS 7:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 7:3"/>Yo te retounen a Josué e te di li: “Pa kite tout pèp la monte; sèlman de oswa twa mil mesye bezwen monte Aï. Pa fè tout pèp la fòse fè efò a, paske yo pa anpil.” <verse eid="JOS 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 7:4"/>Konsa, anviwon twa mil mesye ki sòti nan pèp la te monte; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:17">Lev 26:17</ref></char></note>yo te sove ale devan mesye Aï yo. <verse eid="JOS 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 7:5"/>Mesye Aï yo te frape yo, mete ba anviwon trann-sis nan mesye yo. Yo te kouri dèyè yo soti nan pòtay la jis rive Schebarim pou te frape yo, mete yo ba pandan yo t ap desann, jiskaske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:36">Lev 26:36</ref></char></note>kè pèp la te fonn e te vin tankou dlo.<verse eid="JOS 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 7:6"/>Josué te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 2:12">Job 2:12</ref></char></note>chire rad li, e te tonbe atè sou figi li devan lach SENYÈ a, jis rive nan aswè, ni li menm avèk ansyen a Israël yo. Epi yo te mete pousyè sou tèt yo. <verse eid="JOS 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 7:7"/>Josué te di: “Ay, O SENYÈ Bondye, poukisa Ou te janmen mennen pèp sila a travèse Jourdain an pou livre yo nan men a Amoreyen yo, pou detwi nou? Si sèlman, nou ta dakò rete lòtbò Jourdain an! <verse eid="JOS 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 7:8"/>O SENYÈ, kisa mwen kapab di lòske Israël te vire do yo devan lènmi yo? <verse eid="JOS 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 7:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:12">Egz 32:12</ref></char></note>Paske Canaran avèk tout abitan peyi a va tande sa. Yo va antoure nou e efase non nou sou tè a. Epi kisa Ou va fè pou lonè gran non Ou?”<verse eid="JOS 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 7:10"/>Konsa, SENYÈ a te di a Josué: “Leve ou menm! Poukisa ou te tonbe sou figi ou? <verse eid="JOS 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 7:11"/>Israël te peche. Yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:18-19">Jos 6:18-19</ref></char></note> te anplis, fè transgresyon akò ke Mwen te kòmande yo a. Wi, yo te menm pran kèk nan bagay ki te dedye anba ve yo. Yo te vòlè ak twonpe. Anplis, yo te mete yo pami pwòp afè pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 7:12"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:39-45">Nonb 14:39-45</ref></char></note>fis Israël yo pa kapab kanpe devan lènmi yo. Yo vire do yo devan lènmi yo, paske yo te vin modi. Mwen p ap avèk nou ankò amwenske nou detwi bagay ki anba ve soti nan mitan nou yo.<verse eid="JOS 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 7:13"/>“Leve ou menm! Konsakre pèp la e di: ‘Konsakre nou menm pou demen. Paske konsa, SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:18">Jos 6:18</ref></char></note>“Gen bagay ki anba ve a nan mitan nou, O Israël. Ou pa kapab kanpe devan lènmi ou yo jiskaske ou retire bagay ki anba ve yo soti nan mitan ou.”’”<verse eid="JOS 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 7:14"/>“Nan maten, alò, ou va vin toupre tribi ou yo. Epi li va fèt ke tribi ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 16:33">Pwov 16:33</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a pran pa tiraj osò a va apwoche pa fanmi. Epi fanmi ke SENYÈ a pran an va apwoche pa kay yo. Epi kay ke SENYÈ a pran an va pwoche moun pa moun. <verse eid="JOS 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 7:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:38">I Sam 14:38</ref></char></note>Li va fèt ke sila ki pran bagay ki anba ve a va brile avèk dife, li menm avèk tout sa ki pou li, akoz li te transgrese akò SENYÈ a, e akoz li te fè yon gwo wont an Israël.”<verse eid="JOS 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 7:16"/>Konsa, Josué te leve bonè nan maten e te fè Israël pwoche pa tribi. Tribi Juda a te pran. <verse eid="JOS 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 7:17"/>Li te fè fanmi Juda pwoche; li te pran fanmi Zérarit yo. Li te fè fanmi Zérarit la pwoche moun pa moun e Zabdi te pran. <verse eid="JOS 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 7:18"/>Li te fè fanmi lakay li pwoche, moun pa moun, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:23">Nonb 32:23</ref></char></note>Acan, fis a Carmi, fis a Zabdi, fis a Zérach, nan tribi Juda a te pran.<verse eid="JOS 7:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 7:19"/>Epi Josué te di Acan: “Fis mwen, souple, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 6:5">I Sam 6:5</ref></char></note>bay glwa a SENYÈ a, Bondye a Israël la, epi konfese a Li menm. Di mwen koulye a sa ou te fè a. Pa kache li de mwen.”<verse eid="JOS 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 7:20"/>Konsa, Acan te reponn Josué e te di: “Anverite, mwen te peche kont SENYÈ a, Bondye a tout Israël la; men sa mwen te fè a: <verse eid="JOS 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 7:21"/>Lè mwen te wè nan piyaj la yon bèl manto ki sòti Schinear ak de san sik ajan, yon ba lò a pèz senkant sik, alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:5">Ef 5:5</ref></char></note>mwen te anvi yo e te pran yo. Epi gade byen, yo kache nan tè anndan tant mwen an avèk ajan an anba li.”<verse eid="JOS 7:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 7:22"/>Konsa, Josué te voye mesaje yo. Yo te kouri vè tant lan, epi veye byen, li te kache nan tant li an avèk ajan an anba li. <verse eid="JOS 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 7:23"/>Yo te pran yo soti anndan tant lan, epi yo te pote yo vè Josué avèk tout fis Israël yo pou yo te vide yo devan SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JOS 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 7:24"/>Epi Josué ak tout Israël avèk li te pran Acan, fis a Zérach la, ajan an, manto a, ba lò a, fis li yo, fi li yo, bèf li yo, bourik li yo, mouton li yo, tant li ak tout sa ki te pou li; epi yo te mennen yo monte nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:7">Jos 15:7</ref></char></note>vale Acor a.<verse eid="JOS 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 7:25"/>Josué te di: “Poukisa ou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:18">Jos 6:18</ref></char></note>twouble nou? Jodi a, SENYÈ a va twouble ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 7:25">Konsa, tout Israël te lapide yo avèk kout wòch. Epi yo te brile yo avèk dife lè yo te fin lapide yo avèk kout wòch. <verse eid="JOS 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 7:26"/>Yo te fè leve sou li yon gwo pil wòch ki kanpe jis rive jodi a. Epi SENYÈ a te vire kite gwo chalè kòlè Li a. Pou sa, non a plas sa a te vin rele <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:10">És 65:10</ref></char></note>Vale Acan jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="JOS 7:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOS 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 8:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di a Josué: “Pa pè, ni dekouraje. Pran tout moun lagè yo avèk ou e leve, monte vè Aï. Ou wè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:2">Jos 6:2</ref></char></note>Mwen te mete nan men ou wa Aï a, pèp li a, vil li a ak peyi li a. <verse eid="JOS 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 8:2"/>Ou va fè a Aï ak tout wa li a menm jan ke ou te fè Jéricho avèk wa li a. Selman, ou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:14">Det 20:14</ref></char></note>pran pou ou menm kòm piyaj, bèt li yo kòm byen nou sezi pou nou menm. Òganize yon anbiskad pou vil la pa dèyè li.”<verse eid="JOS 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 8:3"/>Epi Josué te leve avèk tout moun lagè yo pou monte Aï. Josué te chwazi trant mil mesye, gèrye vanyan, e li te voye yo sòti nan lannwit lan. <verse eid="JOS 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 8:4"/>Li te kòmande yo, e te di: “Gade, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:29">Jij 20:29</ref></char></note>ap fè anbiskad vil la soti pa dèyè li. Pa sòti lwen vil la men nou tout, mete nou touprè.<verse eid="JOS 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 8:5"/>“Mwen menm avèk tout moun ki avè m yo, nou va apwoche vil la. Epi lè yo sòti deyò pou rankontre nou kòm yon premye fwa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:32">Jij 20:32</ref></char></note>nou va sove ale devan yo. <verse eid="JOS 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 8:6"/>Yo va sòti pou kouri dèyè nou jiskaske nou pati kite vil la, paske yo va di: ‘Y ap sove ale devan nou tankou premye fwa a.’ Konsa, nou va sove ale devan yo. <verse eid="JOS 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 8:7"/>Epi nou va leve anbiskad nou e pran posesyon vil la; paske SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, va livre li nan men nou. <verse eid="JOS 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 8:8"/>Alò, li va rive lè nou fin sezi vil la, ke nou va mete dife nan vil la. Nou va fè li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:16-18">Det 20:16-18</ref></char></note>selon pawòl SENYÈ a. Nou wè, mwen te kòmande nou an.”<verse eid="JOS 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 8:9"/>Konsa, Josué te voye yo ale. Yo te ale nan plas anbiskad la, e yo te rete antre Béthel avèk Aï, nan lwès a Aï; men Josué te pase nwit lan pami moun yo.<verse eid="JOS 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 8:10"/>Alò, Josué te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:3">Jen 22:3</ref></char></note>leve bonè nan maten, e li te rasanble pèp la, epi li te monte avèk ansyen Israël yo devan pèp la pou ale Aï. <verse eid="JOS 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 8:11"/>Tout moun lagè ki te avèk li yo te monte vin toupre. Yo te rive devan vil la, e te fè kan an sou akote nò toupre Aï a. Koulye a te gen yon vale antre yo menm avèk Aï. <verse eid="JOS 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 8:12"/>Li te pran anviwon senk mil mesye, e li te plase yo an anbiskad antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:8">Jen 12:8</ref></char></note>Béthel avèk Aï nan kote lwès vil la. <verse eid="JOS 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 8:13"/>Konsa, yo te pozisyone moun yo, tout lame ki te nan kote nò vil la ak gad an aryè nan kote lwès vil la. Josué te antre pandan nwit sa a nan mitan vale a.<verse eid="JOS 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 8:14"/>Li te vin rive ke lè wa Aï la te wè sa, mesye lavil yo te kouri leve bonè pou sòti rankontre Israël nan batay la, li menm avèk tout pèp li a nan plas chwazi a devan plèn dezè a. Men li pa t konnen ke te gen yon anbiskad kont li dèyè vil la. <verse eid="JOS 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 8:15"/>Josué avèk tout Israël te fè pòz kòmsi yo te fin bat devan yo e yo te sove ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:61">Jos 15:61</ref></char></note>pa chemen dezè a. <verse eid="JOS 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 8:16"/>Tout pèp ki te nan vil la te rele ansanm pou kouri dèyè yo. Konsa, yo te kouri dèyè Josué e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 20:31">Jij 20:31</ref></char></note> li te rale yo soti kite vil la. <verse eid="JOS 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 8:17"/>Konsa, pa t gen yon gason ki rete nan Aï ni Béthel, yo te kite vil la san gade pou te kouri dèyè Israël.<verse eid="JOS 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 8:18"/>Epi SENYÈ a te di a Josué: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:15">Egz 14:15</ref></char></note>“Lonje lans ki nan men ou an vè Aï; paske Mwen va ba ou li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 8:18">Konsa, Josué te lonje lans ki te nan men l lan vè vil la. <verse eid="JOS 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 8:19"/>Mesye nan anbiskad yo te leve vit nan plas yo, epi lè li te lonje men l, yo te kouri antre nan vil la pou te kaptire li. Byen vit, yo mete dife nan vil la.<verse eid="JOS 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 8:20"/>Lè mesye Aï yo te gade an aryè, vwala, lafimen vil la te vin leve rive jis nan syèl la. Konsa, yo pa t gen kote pou sove ale, ni isit, ni la, paske moun ki t ap sove ale vè dezè yo te vire kont sila ki t ap swiv yo.<verse eid="JOS 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 8:21"/>Lè Josué avèk tout Israël te wè ke fòs anbiskad la te kaptire vil la, e ke lafimen te monte, yo te vire retounen pou touye mesye Aï yo. <verse eid="JOS 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 8:22"/>Lòt yo nan vil la te sòti pou rankontre yo. Men yo te kwense nan mitan Israël, yon pati bò isit ak yon pati bò laba, epi yo te touye yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:8">Jos 8:8</ref></char></note>jis pèsòn pa t rete nan sila ki te chape sove ale yo. <verse eid="JOS 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 8:23"/>Yo te pran wa Aï a vivan e yo te mennen li kote Josué.<verse eid="JOS 8:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 8:24"/>Alò, lè Israël te fin touye tout abitan Aï yo nan chan dezè a kote yo te kouri dèyè yo, e yo tout te tonbe pa lam nepe jiskaske yo te detwi nèt, alò, tout Israël te retounen Aï pou te frape li avèk lam nepe. <verse eid="JOS 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 8:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:16-18">Det 20:16-18</ref></char></note>Tout moun ki te tonbe nan jou sa a, ni lòm ni fanm te douz mil—tout se moun Aï. <verse eid="JOS 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 8:26"/>Paske Josué <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:11-12">Egz 17:11-12</ref></char></note>pa t desann men l ki te toujou lonje ak lans lan jiskaske li te fin detwi nèt tout moun ki rete Aï yo. <verse eid="JOS 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 8:27"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:2">Jos 8:2</ref></char></note>Israël te pran sèlman bèt avèk byen sezi a kòm piyaj pa yo, selon pawòl ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Josué a.<verse eid="JOS 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 8:28"/>Konsa, Josué te brile Aï. Li te fè li tounen yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:22-23">Det 21:22-23</ref></char></note>pil ranblè jis pou tout tan, yon kote ki dezole jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="JOS 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 8:29"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:22-23">Det 21:22-23</ref></char></note>Li te pann wa Aï a sou yon bwa jis rive nan aswè. Lè solèy la te kouche , Josué te bay lòd pou yo te retire kò li nan bwa a pou te jete li nan antre pòtay vil la, e leve sou li yon gwo pil gwo wòch ki kanpe jis jodi a.<verse eid="JOS 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 8:30"/>Konsa, Josué te bati yon lotèl a SENYÈ a, Bondye a Israël la, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:2-8">Det 27:2-8</ref></char></note>Mòn Ébal. <verse eid="JOS 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 8:31"/>Li te fèt jis jan ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te kòmande fis Israël yo, jan sa ekri nan liv lalwa Moïse la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:25">Egz 20:25</ref></char></note>yon lotèl avèk wòch ki pa taye, sou sila okenn mesye pa voye yon zouti fè. Yo te ofri sou li ofrann brile a SENYÈ a, e te fè sakrifis ofrann lapè yo. <verse eid="JOS 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 8:32"/>Josué te ekri la sou wòch yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 27:2-8">Det 27:2-8</ref></char></note>yon kopi lalwa Moïse la. Li te ekri l nan prezans a fis Israël yo.<verse eid="JOS 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 8:33"/>Tout Israël avèk ansyen yo ak ofisye yo ak jij yo te kanpe sou toude kote lach la devan prèt Levit ki te pote lach akò SENYÈ a, etranje kon natif. Mwatye nan yo te kanpe devan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 11:29">Det 11:29</ref></char></note>Mòn Garizim e mwatye nan yo devan Mòn Ébal, jis jan ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te bay kòmand nan oparavan an, pou beni pèp Israël la. <verse eid="JOS 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 8:34"/>Epi apre, li te li tout pawòl lalwa yo, benediksyon yo avèk malediksyon yo, selon tout sa ki ekri nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:8">Jos 1:8</ref></char></note>liv lalwa a. <verse eid="JOS 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 8:35"/>Pa t gen menm yon mo nan tout sa ke Moïse te kòmande yo ke Josué pa t li devan tout asanble Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:36">Egz 12:36</ref></char></note>avèk fanm ak pitit yo ak etranje ki te rete pami yo.<verse eid="JOS 8:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOS 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 9:1"/>Alò, lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:29">Nonb 13:29</ref></char></note>tout wa ki te lòtbò Jourdain nan peyi kolin yo, nan peyi ba plèn ak nan tout kot Gran Lamè a bò kote Liban, Etyen an, avèk Amoreyen an, Kananeyen an, Ferezyen an Evyen an ak Jebizyen an te tande koze sa, <verse eid="JOS 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 9:2"/>yo te reyini ansanm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:3-5">Sòm 83:3-5</ref></char></note>yon sèl bi pou goumen avèk Josué e avèk Israël.<verse eid="JOS 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 9:3"/>Lè pèp la nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:17">Jos 9:17</ref></char></note>Gabaon te tande sa ke Josué te fè ak Jéricho avèk Aï, <verse eid="JOS 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 9:4"/>yo menm, osi, yo te aji avèk riz. Yo te pati kòm reprezantan a pèp la. Yo te mete vye makout sou bourik yo, avèk ansyen kwi diven epwize ki te chire e rekoud, <verse eid="JOS 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 9:5"/>avèk sapat ki te epwize e ranje nan pye yo, rad epwize sou yo menm avèk sèlman pen sèk e menm kanni. <verse eid="JOS 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 9:6"/>Yo te ale kote Josué nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 5:10">Jos 5:10</ref></char></note>kan an nan Guilgal, e yo te di a li menm avèk mesye Israël yo: “Nou sòti nan yon peyi byen lwen. Konsa, fè yon akò avèk nou.”<verse eid="JOS 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 9:7"/>Mesye Israël yo te di a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:1">Jos 9:1</ref></char></note>Evyen yo: “Petèt ou rete touprè nou: donk, kijan nou kap fè akò avèk ou?”<verse eid="JOS 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 9:8"/>Men yo te di Josué: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:11">Det 20:11</ref></char></note>“Nou se sèvitè ou.” Alò, Josué te di yo: “Ki moun nou ye e kibò nou sòti?”<verse eid="JOS 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 9:9"/>Yo te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:16-17">Jos 9:16-17</ref></char></note>“Sèvitè ou yo te sòti nan yon peyi byen lwen, akoz repitasyon a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an; paske nou te tande rapò a Li menm ak tout sa ke Li te fè an Égypte yo, <verse eid="JOS 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 9:10"/>ak tout sa Li te fè a wa Amoreyen yo ki te lòtbò Jourdain an, a Sihon, wa Hesbon an ak Og, wa Basan an, ki te Ashtaroth. <verse eid="JOS 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 9:11"/>Pou sa, tout ansyen nou yo avèk tout abitan a peyi nou yo te pale nou e te di: ‘Mete pwovizyon nan men nou pou vwayaj la. Ale rankontre yo e di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:8">Jos 9:8</ref></char></note>“Nou se sèvitè ou; alò, fè yon akò avèk nou.”’ <verse eid="JOS 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 9:12"/>Sa se pen nou e li te cho lè nou te pran li pou pwovizyon nou e sòti lakay nou nan jou ke nou te pati pou vin kote ou a, men koulye a, gade, li rasi. <verse eid="JOS 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 9:13"/>Kwi diven sa yo lè nou te plen yo, yo te tounèf; epi gade, yo vin chire. Epi rad nou avèk sapat nou epwize akoz vwayaj la ki te tèlman long.”<verse eid="JOS 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 9:14"/>Konsa, mesye Israël yo te aksepte pran nan pwovizyon yo, e yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Nonb 27:21</ref></char></note>pa t mande SENYÈ a konsèy. <verse eid="JOS 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 9:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:32">Egz 23:32</ref></char></note>Josué te fè lapè avèk yo. Li te fè yon akò avèk yo pou lese yo viv, epi dirijan kongregasyon an te sèmante yon ve ak yo.<verse eid="JOS 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 9:16"/>Li te vin rive nan fen twa jou yo, lè yo te fin fè akò avèk yo, ke yo te tande ke yo te vwazen ki te rete nan peyi yo. <verse eid="JOS 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 9:17"/>Alò, fis Israël yo te deplase, e te vin kote vil yo a nan twazyèm jou a. Vil yo te: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:25">Jos 18:25</ref></char></note>Gabaon, Kephira, Beéroth ak Kirjath-Jearim. <verse eid="JOS 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 9:18"/>Fis Israël yo pa t frape yo akoz dirijan kongregasyon an te sèmante a yo pa SENYÈ a, Bondye a tout Israël la.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 9:18">Epi tout kongregasyon an te plenyen kont dirijan yo. <verse eid="JOS 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 9:19"/>Men tout dirijan yo te di a tout kongregasyon an: “Nou te sèmante a yo pa SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. Koulye a, nou pa kapab touche yo. <verse eid="JOS 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 9:20"/>Men kisa nou va fè yo; kite yo viv pou kòlè pa vin sou nou pou ve ke nou sèmante a yo a.” <verse eid="JOS 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 9:21"/>Dirijan yo te di a yo menm: “Kite yo viv.” Konsa, yo te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:11">Det 29:11</ref></char></note>moun ki pou koupe bwa ak rale dlo pou tout kongregasyon an, jis jan ke dirijan yo te pale yo a. <verse eid="JOS 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 9:22"/>Epi Josué te rele yo pou te pale avèk yo. Li te di: “Poukisa nou te twonpe nou, e di: ‘Nou lwen nou,’ <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:16">Jos 9:16</ref></char></note>lè vrèman nou ap viv nan mitan peyi nou an? <verse eid="JOS 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 9:23"/>Koulye a, pou sa, nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:25">Jen 9:25</ref></char></note>modi e nou p ap janm sispann jwe wòl kòm esklav, ni pou koupe bwa ni pou rale dlo pou kay Bondye mwen an.”<verse eid="JOS 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 9:24"/>Alò, yo te reponn Josué e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:9">Jos 9:9</ref></char></note>“Akoz li te, anverite, pale a sèvitè ou yo, jan SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, te kòmande sèvitè li, Moïse, pou ba ou tout peyi a, e pou detwi tout pèp ki rete nan peyi a devan ou. Konsa, nou te fè gwo perèz pou lavi nou akoz de ou, e nou te fè bagay sa a. <verse eid="JOS 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 9:25"/>Alò, gade, nou nan men ou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 16:6">Jen 16:6</ref></char></note>Fè avèk nou sa ki sanble bon e jis nan zye ou pou fè nou.”<verse eid="JOS 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 9:26"/>Se konsa, li te fè yo, e te livre yo nan men a fis Israël yo pou yo pa t touye yo. <verse eid="JOS 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 9:27"/>Men Josué te bay yo ransèyman soti nan menm jou sa a, kòm moun ki koupe bwa ak rale dlo pou kongregasyon an ak lotèl SENYÈ a, jis rive nan jou sila, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5">Det 12:5</ref></char></note>nan plas ke Li ta chwazi a.<verse eid="JOS 9:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOS 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 10:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive ke lè Adoni-Tsédek, wa Jérusalem nan te tande ke Josué te kapte Aï e te detwi li nèt (jis jan ke li te fè Jéricho avèk wa li a, konsa li te fè Aïavèk wa li a), e ke pèp Gabaon an te fè lapè avèk Israël e yo te rete nan mitan yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:21">Jos 8:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 9:15">Jos 9:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 10:2"/>ke li te vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:14-16">Egz 15:14-16</ref></char></note>pè anpil, akoz Gabaon te yon gran vil tankou youn nan vil wayal yo, epi akoz li te pi gran ke Aï e tout gason li yo te pwisan.<verse eid="JOS 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 10:3"/>Pou sa, Adoni-Tsédek, wa Jérusalem nan te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:23">Jos 10:23</ref></char></note>Hoham, wa Hébron an ak Piream, wa Jarmuth ak Japhia, wa Lakis avèk Debir, wa Eglon an, e te di: <verse eid="JOS 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 10:4"/>“Vin monte kote mwen pou ede m. Annou atake Gabaon, paske yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:15">Jos 9:15</ref></char></note>fè lapè avèk Josué e avèk fis Israël yo.”<verse eid="JOS 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 10:5"/>Konsa, senk wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:29">Nonb 13:29</ref></char></note>Amoreyen yo, wa Jérusalem nan, wa Hébron an, wa Jarmuth lan, wa Lakis la ak wa Eglon an te monte, yo menm avèk tout lame yo, yo te fè kan akote Gabaon pou te goumen kont li.<verse eid="JOS 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 10:6"/>Mesye Gabaon yo te voye kote Josué kote kan Guilgal la, e te di: “Pa abandone sèvitè ou yo; vin monte kote nou pou ede nou; paske tout wa Amoreyen ki rete nan peyi kolin yo te vin rasanble kont nou.”<verse eid="JOS 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 10:7"/>Alò, Josué te monte soti Guilgal, li menm ansanm ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:1">Jos 8:1</ref></char></note>tout moun lagè yo ak tout gèrye vanyan yo.<verse eid="JOS 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 10:8"/>SENYÈ a te di a Josué: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5-9">Jos 1:5-9</ref></char></note>“Pa pè yo, paske Mwen te mete yo nan men ou. Pa menm youn nan yo va kanpe devan ou.”<verse eid="JOS 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 10:9"/>Konsa, Josué te parèt sou yo sibitman akoz yo te mache nan nwit lan soti Guilgal. <verse eid="JOS 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 10:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:23">Det 7:23</ref></char></note>Epi SENYÈ a te fè yo fè dega devan Israël. Li te touye yo avèk yon gwo masak nan Gabaon, Li te kouri dèyè yo nan chemen pant Beth-Horon e Li te frape yo jis rive Azéka, avèk Makkéda.<verse eid="JOS 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 10:11"/>Pandan yo t ap sove ale devan Israël, pandan yo t ap desann pant Beth-Horon an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:12">Sòm 18:12</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te voye gwo wòch sòti nan syèl la sou yo jis rive Azéka, e yo te mouri. Pifò nan yo te mouri akoz gwo lagrèl ke sila ke fis Israël yo te touye avèk lam nepe yo.<verse eid="JOS 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 10:12"/>Konsa, Josué te pale avèk SENYÈ a nan jou ke SENYÈ a te livre Amoreyen yo devan fis Israël yo. Li te pale devan tout zye a fis Israël yo: “O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 3:11">Hab 3:11</ref></char></note>solèy, kanpe an plas sou Gabaon! Epi lalin nan, rete la, nan vale Ajalon!”<verse eid="JOS 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 10:13"/>Alò, solèy la te kanpe e lalin nan pa t deplase Jiskaske nasyon an te fè revandikasyon an yo menm, sou lènmi yo. Èske sa pa ekri nan liv Jaser a? Solèy la te rete nan mitan syèl la e li pa t deplase pandan anviwon yon jou konplè.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 1:18">II Sam 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 38:8">És 38:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JOS 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 10:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:14">Egz 14:14</ref></char></note>Pa t gen jou tankou sila a ni devan li, ni apre li, lè SENYÈ a te koute vwa a yon moun; paske SENYÈ a te goumen pou Israël.<verse eid="JOS 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 10:15"/>Konsa, Josué avèk tout Israël avèk li te retounen nan kan an Guilgal. <verse eid="JOS 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 10:16"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:5">Jos 10:5</ref></char></note>senk wa sila yo te sove ale pou te kache kò yo nan gwòt Makkéda a. <verse eid="JOS 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 10:17"/>Li te pale a Jousé ke: “Senk wa yo te twouve kache nan gwòt Makkéda a.” <verse eid="JOS 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 10:18"/>Josué te di: “Woule gwo wòch yo kont bouch gwòt la; epi mete mesye yo veye l, <verse eid="JOS 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 10:19"/>men pa rete nou menm. Swiv lènmi nou yo pou atake yo pa dèyè. Pa kite yo antre nan vil yo, paske SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, te livre yo nan men nou.”<verse eid="JOS 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 10:20"/>Li te vin rive ke lè Josué avèk fis Israël yo te fin touye yo avèk yon gwo masak, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:16">Det 20:16</ref></char></note>jiskaske yo tout te fin detwi e sila ki te chape yo, yo te antre nan vil fòtifye yo, <verse eid="JOS 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 10:21"/>pou tout pèp la te retounen nan kan an kote Josué nan Makkéda anpè. Pèsòn pa t pale yon mo kont fis Israël yo.<verse eid="JOS 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 10:22"/>Epi Jousé te di: “Ouvri bouch gwòt la e mennen senk wa sa yo sòti nan gwòt la.” <verse eid="JOS 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 10:23"/>Se konsa yo te fè, yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:24">Det 7:24</ref></char></note>mennen senk wa sila yo soti deyò gwòt la: wa Jérusalem nan, wa Hébron an, wa Jarmuth lan, wa Lakis la ak wa Eglon an. <verse eid="JOS 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 10:24"/>Lè yo te mennen wa sa yo sòti kote Josué, Josué te rele tout mesye Israël yo. Li te di a chèf gèrye yo ki te ale avèk l, “Vin <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:3">Mal 4:3</ref></char></note>mete pye nou sou kou a wa sa yo.” Epi yo te vini epou te mete pye yo sou kou yo.<verse eid="JOS 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 10:25"/>Epi Josué te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:8">Jos 10:8</ref></char></note>“Pa pè, ni dekouraje! Kenbe fèm e pran kouraj, paske konsa SENYÈ a va fè a tout lènmi nou yo lè yo goumen avèk nou.” <verse eid="JOS 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 10:26"/>Epi answit, Josué te frape yo e te mete yo a lanmò, epi te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:29">Jos 8:29</ref></char></note>pann yo sou senk pyebwa. Yo te pann sou bwa yo jis rive nan aswè.<verse eid="JOS 10:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 10:27"/>Li te rive nan lè solèy kouche ke Josué te bay yon kòmand pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:22-23">Det 21:22-23</ref></char></note>yo te desann yo nan pyebwa yo, e jete yo nan gwòt kote yo te kache kò yo a. Yo te mete gwo wòch sou bouch gwòt la, ki la jis jodi a.<verse eid="JOS 10:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 10:28"/>Alò, Josué te kaptire Makkéda nan jou sa a. Li te frape l, ansanm ak wa li a avèk lam nepe. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:16">Det 20:16</ref></char></note>Li te konplètman detwi li ak tout moun ki te ladann. Li pa t kite pèsòn vivan. Konsa li te fè a wa Makkéda a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:21">Jos 6:21</ref></char></note>jis jan ke li te fè a wa Jéricho a.<verse eid="JOS 10:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 10:29"/>Epi Josué avèk tout Israël avèk li te pase soti Makkéda a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:42">15:42</ref></char></note>Libna pou te goumen kont Libna. <verse eid="JOS 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 10:30"/>SENYÈ a te bay Libna tou ansanm ak wa li nan men Israël. Li te frape li ak tout moun ki te ladann avèk lam nepe. Li pa t kite pèsòn vivan ladann. Konsa li te fè a wa a li menm bagay ke li te fè a wa Jéricho a.<verse eid="JOS 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 10:31"/>Konsa, Josué avèk tout Israël avèk li te pase soti nan Libna a Lakis. Yo te fè kan kontra li e te goumen kont li. <verse eid="JOS 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 10:32"/>SENYÈ a te bay Lakis nan men Israël. Li te kaptire li nan dezyèm jou a. Li te frape li ak tout moun ki te ladann avèk lam nepe, jis jan ke li te fè a Libna a.<verse eid="JOS 10:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 10:33"/>Alò Horam, wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:3-10">Jos 16:3-10</ref></char></note>Guézer a, te monte pou ede Lakis. Jousé te bat li ak pèp li a jiskaske li pa t kite moun vivan.<verse eid="JOS 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 10:34"/>Konsa, Josué avèk tout Israël te kite Lakis pou Églon; Yo te fè kan kontra li e te goumen kont li. <verse eid="JOS 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 10:35"/>Yo te kaptire li nan jou sila a e te frape li avèk lam nepe. Nan jou sa a, li te konplètman detwi tout moun ki te ladann, jis jan li te fè a Lakis la.<verse eid="JOS 10:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 10:36"/>Alò, Josué avèk tout Israël avèk li te monte soti Églon a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:22">Nonb 13:22</ref></char></note>Hébron, epi yo te goumen kont li. <verse eid="JOS 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 10:37"/>Yo te kaptire li, frape li ak wa li a avèk tout vil li yo ak tout moun ki te ladann avèk lam nepe. Li pa t kite pèsòn vivan, jis jan li te fè Eglon an. Li te konplètman detwi li avèk tout moun ki te ladann.<verse eid="JOS 10:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 10:38"/>Epi Josué avèk tout Israël avèk li te retounen a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:15">Jos 15:15</ref></char></note>Debir pou yo te goumen kont li. <verse eid="JOS 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 10:39"/>Li te kaptire li avèk wa li a, ak tout vil li yo. Yo te frape yo avèk lam nepe e te detwi yo nèt tout moun ladann. Li pa t kite moun vivan. Jis jan ke li te fè Hébron an, konsa li te fè Debir avèk wa li a e li te osi fè nan Libna avèk wa li a.<verse eid="JOS 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 10:40"/>Konsa, Josué te frape tout peyi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:7">Det 1:7</ref></char></note>peyi kolin yo avèk Negev la ak bas plèn nan avèk pant yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:24">Det 7:24</ref></char></note>tout wa yo. Li pa t kite moun vivan, men li te konplètman detwi tout moun ki te gen souf lavi, jis jan ke SENYÈ a, Bondye a Israël la, te kòmande a. <verse eid="JOS 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 10:41"/>Josué te frape yo soti Kadès-Barnéa, jis rive Gaza. <verse eid="JOS 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 10:42"/>Jousé te kaptire tout wa sila yo avèk peyi yo nan yon sèl kou, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:7">Det 1:7</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a, Bondye a Israël la, te goumen pou Israël.<verse eid="JOS 10:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 10:43"/>Epi Josué ak tout Israël avèk li te retounen nan kan Guilgal la.<verse eid="JOS 10:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOS 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 11:1"/>Epi li te vin rive ke lè Jabin, wa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:10">Jos 11:10</ref></char></note>Hatsor a, te tande koze a, li te voye kote Jobab, wa Madon an, kote wa Schimron ak kote wa Acschaph, <verse eid="JOS 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 11:2"/>ak wa ki te nan nò nan peyi kolin yo ak nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 12:3">Jos 12:3</ref></char></note>Araba a—-plis nan sid a Kinnéreth, nan ba plèn nan ak sou wotè a Dor nan lwès, <verse eid="JOS 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 11:3"/>vè Kananeyen yo nan lès ak nan lwès, Amoreyen yo, Etyen yo, Ferezyen yo ak Jebizyen yo nan peyi kolin yo ak Evyen yo nan pye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:17">Jos 11:17</ref></char></note>Mòn Hermon nan peyi Mitspa a. <verse eid="JOS 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 11:4"/>Yo te sòti, yo menm avèk tout lame yo avèk yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 7:12">Jij 7:12</ref></char></note>fòs kantite moun tankou grenn sab bò lanmè, avèk anpil cheval ak cha.<verse eid="JOS 11:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 11:5"/>Tout wa sila yo te reyini. Yo te vin fè kan an ansanm vè dlo a Mérom yo pou goumen kont Israël.<verse eid="JOS 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 11:6"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di a Jousé: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:8">Jos 10:8</ref></char></note> “Pa pè akoz yo menm, paske demen nan lè sa a, mwen va livre yo tou mouri devan Israël. Nou va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:4">II Sam 8:4</ref> </char></note>koupe jarèt cheval yo e brile cha yo avèk dife.”<verse eid="JOS 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 11:7"/>Konsa, Jousé avèk tout moun lagè yo te parèt sou yo sibitman toupre dlo Mérom yo pou atake yo. <verse eid="JOS 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 11:8"/>SENYÈ a te livre yo nan men Israël pou yo te genyen yo. Yo te kouri dèyè yo jis rive nan Gran Sidon, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:6">Jos 13:6</ref></char></note>Misrepoth-Maïm avèk vale a Mitspa nan lès. Yo te frape yo jiskaske pèsòn pa t viv ladan yo. <verse eid="JOS 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 11:9"/>Josué te fè yo jan SENYÈ a te pale li a. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:6">Jos 11:6</ref></char></note>koupe jarèt cheval yo, e brile cha yo avèk dife.<verse eid="JOS 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 11:10"/>Epi Josué te retounen fè bak nan moman sa a pou te kaptire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:1">Jos 11:1</ref></char></note>Hatsor e frape wa li a avèk nepe. Paske Hatsor, oparavan, te chèf an tèt tout wayòm sila yo. <verse eid="JOS 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 11:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 20:16">Det 20:16</ref></char></note>Yo te frape tout moun ki te ladann avèk lam nepe. Yo te detwi yo nèt. Pa t gen pèsòn ki te rete ap respire. Epi li te brile Hatsor avèk dife.<verse eid="JOS 11:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 11:12"/>Josué te kaptire tout vil a wa sila yo, ak tout wa yo. Li te frape yo avèk lam nepe e li te detwi yo nèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:50-52">Nonb 33:50-52</ref></char></note>jis jan ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a te kòmande a. <verse eid="JOS 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 11:13"/>Sepandan, Israël pa t brile okenn nan vil ki te kanpe sou pwòp ti mòn pa yo, sof ke Hatsor sèl, ke Josué te brile. <verse eid="JOS 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 11:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:11-12">Nonb 31:11-12</ref></char></note>Tout piyaj lakay sila yo ak bèt yo, fis Israël yo te pran yo kòm byen sezi pa yo. Men yo te frape tout moun avèk lam nepe jiskaske yo te detwi yo. Yo pa t kite pèsòn respire.<verse eid="JOS 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 11:15"/>Jis jan SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse, sèvitè li a, konsa Moïse te kòmande Josué, e konsa Josué te fè. Li pa t kite anyen pa fèt nan tout sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.<verse eid="JOS 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 11:16"/>Konsa, Josué te pran tout teritwa sa a: peyi ti kolin yo ak tout Negev la, tout peyi Gosen nan, ba plèn nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:2">Jos 11:2</ref></char></note>Araba a, peyi ti kolin Israël la ak ba plèn li, <verse eid="JOS 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 11:17"/>soti nan Mòn Halak ki leve vè Séir, menm jis rive lwen nan Baal-Gad nan vale Liban nan pye Mòn Hermon. Konsa, li te kaptire <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:24">Det 7:24</ref></char></note>tout wa yo, li te frape yo ba e te mete yo a lanmò.<verse eid="JOS 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 11:18"/>Josué te pouswiv lagè pandan anpil tan avèk tout wa sa yo. <verse eid="JOS 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 11:19"/>Pa t gen yon vil ki te fè lapè avèk fis Israël yo, sof ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:3-7">Jos 9:3-7</ref></char></note>Evyen ki te rete Gabaon yo. Se nan batay menm yo te pran yo. <verse eid="JOS 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 11:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:7">Egz 14:7</ref></char></note>Paske se te volonte SENYÈ a pou yo ta fè kè yo vin di, pou yo te rankontre Israël nan batay, pou Li ta kapab detwi yo nèt, jis jan ke SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la.<verse eid="JOS 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 11:21"/>Josué te vini nan tan sa a, e li te koupe <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:13">Nonb 13:13</ref></char></note>Anakim yo nan peyi ti kolin yo, soti Hébron, soti Debir, soti Anab ak tout peyi ti kolin nan Juda yo e soti nan tout peyi ti kolin an Israël yo. Josué te detwi yo nèt avèk vil yo. <verse eid="JOS 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 11:22"/>Pa t gen Anakim ki te rete nan peyi fis Israël yo. Sèlman nan Gaza, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 17:4">I Sam 17:4</ref></char></note>Gath ak nan Asdod kèk te rete.<verse eid="JOS 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 11:23"/>Konsa, Josué te pran tout peyi a, selon tout sa ke SENYÈ a te pale a Moïse yo; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:38">Det 1:38</ref></char></note>Josué te bay li kòm eritaj a Israël selon divizyon pa yo selon tribi pa yo. Konsa, peyi a te gen repo kont lagè a.<verse eid="JOS 11:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOS 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 12:1"/>Alò, sila yo se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Nonb 32:33</ref></char></note>wa a peyi ke fis Israël yo te fin bat e tèren ke yo te vin posede lòtbò Jourdain an vè solèy leve a, soti nan vale Arnon an jis rive nan Mòn Hermon ak tout Araba vè lès: <verse eid="JOS 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 12:2"/>Sihon, wa Amoreyen yo, ki te rete Hesbon, ki te domine <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 2:36">Det 2:36</ref></char></note>soti Aroër ki akote vale Arnon an, ni mitan vale a ak mwatye Galaad, menm jis rive nan ti rivyè Jabbok la, lizyè a fis Ammon an; <verse eid="JOS 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 12:3"/>epi nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:2">Jos 11:2</ref></char></note>Araba jis rive nan lanmè Kinnéreth la, vè lès, jis rive nan lanmè Araba a, ki se Lame Sale a, vè lès vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:20">Jos 13:20</ref> </char></note>Beth-Jeschimoth ak nan sid, nan pye pant a Mòn Pisga yo; <verse eid="JOS 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 12:4"/>epi teritwa Og, wa Basan an, youn nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:11">Det 3:11</ref></char></note>retay Rephaïm ki te rete Aschtaroth ak Édréï, <verse eid="JOS 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 12:5"/>epi li te domine sou Mòn Hermon ak Salca avèk tout Basan, jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:14">Det 3:14</ref></char></note>lizyè a Gechouryen ak Maakatyen yo, epi mwatye Galaad, pou rive nan lizyè Sihon, wa Hesbon an.<verse eid="JOS 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 12:6"/>Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, ak fis Israël yo te bat yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Nonb 32:33</ref></char></note>Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te bay yo a Ribenit ak Gadit yo, avèk mwatye tribi Manassé a, kòm posesyon.<verse eid="JOS 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 12:7"/>Alò, sila yo se wa peyi ke Josué avèk fis Israël yo te bat lòtbò Jourdain an, vè lwès, soti Baal-Gad nan vale Liban, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:17">Jos 11:17</ref></char></note> jis rive nan Mòn Halak ki leve vè Séir. Epi Josué te bay li a tribi Israël yo kòm posesyon selon divizyon pa yo, <verse eid="JOS 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 12:8"/>nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:16">Jos 11:16</ref></char></note>peyi ti kolin yo, nan ba plèn nan, nan Araba a, nan pant yo, nan dezè a, nan Negev la; Etyen an, Amoreyen an, Kananeyen an, Ferezyen an, Evyen ak Jebizyen an:<verse eid="JOS 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 12:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 6:2">Jos 6:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>wa a Jéricho a, youn; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:29">Jos 8:29</ref></char></note>wa a Ai ki akote Béthel la, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 12:10"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 10:23">Jos 10:23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>wa a Jérusalem nan, youn; wa a Hébron an, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 12:11"/>wa a Jarmuth lan, youn; wa a Lakis la, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 12:12"/>wa a Églon an, youn; wa a Guézer a, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 12:13"/>wa a Debir a, youn; wa a Guéder a, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 12:14"/>wa a Horma a, youn; wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:1">Nonb 21:1</ref></char></note>Arad la, youn<verse eid="JOS 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 12:15"/>wa a Libna a, youn; wa a Adulam nan, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 12:16"/>wa a Makkéda a, youn; wa a Béthel la, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 12:17"/>wa a Tappuach la, youn; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:10">I Wa 4:10</ref></char></note>wa a Hépher a, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 12:18"/>wa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:4">Jos 13:4</ref></char></note>Aphek la, youn; wa Lascharon an, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 12:19"/>wa a Madon an, youn; wa a Hatsor a, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 12:20"/>wa a Schimron-Meron an, youn; wa a Acschaph la, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 12:21"/>wa a Taanac la, youn; wa a Meguiddo a, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 12:22"/>wa a Kédesh la, youn; wa a Joknaem nan Carmel la, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 12:23"/>wa a Dor a, youn; wa a Gojim nan, toupre Guilgal, youn;<verse eid="JOS 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 12:24"/>wa a Thirtsa a, youn. Total wa yo, tranteyen.<verse eid="JOS 12:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOS 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 13:1"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:10">Jos 14:10</ref></char></note>Josué te vin vye e avanse nan laj lè SENYÈ a te di li: “Ou vin vye e avanse nan laj e anpil nan tè a rete san posede.<verse eid="JOS 13:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 13:2"/>“Men tè ki rete yo: tout kote Filisten yo ak tout sila a Gechouryen yo; <verse eid="JOS 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 13:3"/>soti nan Schichor ki nan lès Égypte, jis rive nan fwontyè Ékron ki nan nò (li konte tankou Kananeyen yo); <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 6:4-16">I Sam 6:4-16</ref></char></note>senk prens a Filisten yo: sa Gaza a, sa Asdod la, sa Askalon an, sa Gath la ak sa Ekron an e pa Avyen yo. <verse eid="JOS 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 13:4"/>Nan sid, tout teritwa a Canaan yo ak Meara ki pou Sidonyen yo, soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 12:18">Jos 12:18</ref></char></note>Aphek jis rive nan fwontyè Amoreyen yo; <verse eid="JOS 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 13:5"/>epi teritwa Gibliyen yo avèk tout Liban, vè lès, soti Baal-Gad anba Mòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:18">I Wa 5:18</ref></char></note> Hermon jis rive nan Lebo-Hamath.<verse eid="JOS 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 13:6"/>“Tout pèp ki te rete nan peyi ti kolin yo soti Liban jis rive Misrephoth-Maim, tout Sidonyen yo, mwen va pouse yo ale soti devan fis Israël yo. Se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:54">Nonb 33:54</ref></char></note>sèl a Israël pou bay li kòm eritaj, jan Mwen te kòmande ou a. <verse eid="JOS 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 13:7"/>Koulye a, pou sa, divize tè sa a kòm eritaj a nèf tribi yo avèk mwatye tribi a Manassé a.”<verse eid="JOS 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 13:8"/>Avèk lòt mwatye tribi a, Ribenit yo ak Gadit yo te resevwa eritaj pa yo ke Moïse te ba yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 12:1-6">Jos 12:1-6</ref></char></note>lòtbò Jourdain an nan lès, jis jan ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te bay yo a: <verse eid="JOS 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 13:9"/>soti Aroër ki akote vale Arnon an, avèk vil ki nan mitan vale a ak tout plèn Médeba a, jis rive nan Dibon; <verse eid="JOS 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 13:10"/>epi tout vil a Sihon yo, wa a Amoreyen yo, ki te renye nan Hesbon yo, jis rive nan lizyè fis a Ammon yo; <verse eid="JOS 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 13:11"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:35">Jen 37:35</ref></char></note>Galaad ak teritwa a Gechouryen yo avèk Maakatyen yo, tout Mòn Hermon an ak tout Basan jis rive Salca; <verse eid="JOS 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 13:12"/>tout wayòm a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:11">Det 3:11</ref></char></note>Og yo nan Basan ki te renye nan Ashtaroth ak nan Édréï, (se te li sèl ki te rete kòm retay a Rephaïm yo); paske Moïse te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:24">Nonb 21:24</ref></char></note>frape yo e deplase yo.<verse eid="JOS 13:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 13:13"/>Men fis Israël yo pa t deplase Gechouryen yo ak Maakatyen yo; paske Gueschur avèk Maacath rete pami Israël yo jis jodi a.<verse eid="JOS 13:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 13:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:1">Det 18:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sèlman a tribi Levi a, li pa t bay eritaj. Ofrann pa dife a SENYÈ a, Bondye a Israël la, se eritaj pa yo, jan Li te pale yo a.<verse eid="JOS 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 13:15"/>Epi Moïse te bay a tribi fis a Ruben yo selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 13:16"/>Teritwa pa yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:9">Jos 13:9</ref></char></note>soti Aroër ki arebò vale Arnon an, avèk vil nan mitan vale a ak tout plèn akote Médeba a; <verse eid="JOS 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 13:17"/>Hesbon ak tout vil pa li yo ki nan plèn nan: Dibon avèk Bamoth-Baal ak Beth-Baal-Meon, <verse eid="JOS 13:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 13:18"/>epi Jahats, Kedémoth, Méphaath, <verse eid="JOS 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 13:19"/>Kirjathaïm, Sibma, Tséreth-Haschachar sou mòn a vale a, <verse eid="JOS 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 13:20"/>Beth-Peor, avèk pant a Pisga yo, Beth-Jeschimoth, <verse eid="JOS 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 13:21"/>tout vil nan plèn yo ak tout wayòm a Sihon an, wa Amoreyen an, ki te renye nan Hesbon, ke Moïse te frape ansanm avèk chèf Madian yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:8">Nonb 31:8</ref></char></note>Évi, Rékem, Tsur, Hur, avèk Reba, prens a Sihon yo, ki te rete nan peyi a. <verse eid="JOS 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 13:22"/>Fis Israël yo, osi, te touye avèk nepe, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:8">Nonb 31:8</ref></char></note>Balaam, fis a Beor a, yon divinò, pami tout lòt ki te mouri nan yo. <verse eid="JOS 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 13:23"/>Lizyè a fis a Ruben yo se te Jourdain an. Sa se te eritaj a fis Ruben yo selon fanmi pa yo, vil ak ti bouk yo.<verse eid="JOS 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 13:24"/>Moïse, osi, te bay tribi Gad la, a fis Gad yo, selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 13:25"/>Teritwa pa yo se te Jazer, tout vil nan Galaad yo ak mwatye peyi a fis Ammon yo, jis rive nan Aroër ki devan Rabba a, <verse eid="JOS 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 13:26"/>epi soti Hesbon, jis rive nan Ramath-Mitspé, Bethonim ak soti Mahanaïm jis rive nan lizyè Debir a; <verse eid="JOS 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 13:27"/>epi nan vale a, Beth-Haram, Beth-Nimra, Succoth ak Tsaphon, sila ki rete nan wayòm Sihon an, wa Hesbon an, avèk Jourdain an kòm lizyè li jis rive nan pwent <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:11">Nonb 34:11</ref></char></note>Lamè Kinnéreth la, lòt kote Jourdain an vè lès. <verse eid="JOS 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 13:28"/>Sa se eritaj a fis a Gad yo selon fanmi, vil yo ak bouk pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 13:29"/>Moïse te, osi, bay yon eritaj a mwatye tribi Manassé a. Li te pou mwatye tribi Manassé a selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 13:30"/>Teritwa pa yo te soti nan Mahanaïm, tout Basan, tout wayòm ki pou Og la, wa Basan an ak tout a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:41">Nonb 32:41</ref></char></note>vil a Jaïr yo ki nan Basan, swasant vil antou. <verse eid="JOS 13:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 13:31"/>Anplis, mwatye nan Galaad, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 9:10">Jos 9:10</ref></char></note>Aschtaroth ak Édréï, vil nan wayòm Og yo, nan Basan, te vin pou fis Makir yo, fis a Manassé yo, pou mwatye a fis Makir yo selon fanmi pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 13:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 13:32"/>Sila yo se teritwa ke Moïse te divize kòm eritaj nan ba plèn a Moab yo, lòtbò Jourdain an, vè Jéricho ki nan lès.<verse eid="JOS 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 13:33"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:1">Det 18:1</ref></char></note>a tribi Levi a, Moïse pa t ba li eritaj. SENYÈ a, Bondye a Israël la, se eritaj pa yo, jan li te pwomèt a yo menm nan.<verse eid="JOS 13:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOS 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 14:1"/>Alò, sila yo se teritwa ke fis Israël yo te eritye nan peyi Canaran an, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:16-29">Nonb 34:16-29</ref></char></note>Éléazar, prèt la ak Josué, fis a Nun nan, ak chèf kay nan tribi a fis Israël yo te divize bay yo kòm eritaj yo, <verse eid="JOS 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 14:2"/>selon tiraj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:55">Nonb 26:55</ref></char></note>osò eritaj pa yo, jan SENYÈ a te kòmande a, pa Moïse pou nèf tribi avèk mwatye tribi a. <verse eid="JOS 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 14:3"/>Paske Moïse te bay eritaj la a de tribi avèk mwatye tribi lòtbò Jourdain an. Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:14">Jos 13:14</ref></char></note>li pa t bay yon eritaj a Levit ki te pami yo. <verse eid="JOS 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 14:4"/>Paske fis Joseph yo te de tribi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:5-11">Jen 41:5-11</ref></char></note>Manassé avèk Éphraïm, e yo pa t bay yon pòsyon a Levit nan peyi yo, sof ke vil pou yo viv ladan yo, avèk teren pa yo pou bèt pa yo ak pou byen pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 14:5"/>Konsa, fis Israël yo te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:11">Nonb 35:11</ref></char></note>jan SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse la. Yo te divize teren an.<verse eid="JOS 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 14:6"/>Alò, fis Juda yo te pwoche toupre Josué nan Guilgal ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:6-30">Nonb 13:6-30</ref></char></note>Caleb, fis a Jephunné a, Kenizyen an. Yo di li: “Ou konnen pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale a Moïse, nonm Bondye a, konsènan ou menm avèk mwen nan Kadès-Barnéa. <verse eid="JOS 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 14:7"/>Mwen te gen karantan lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:1-31">Nonb 13:1-31</ref></char></note>Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te voye mwen sòti nan Kadès Barnéa pou fè espyonaj peyi a. Mwen te mennen pawòl la retounen kote li jan li te ye nan kè m nan. <verse eid="JOS 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 14:8"/>Sepandan, frè m ki te monte avè m yo te fè kè a pèp la fann avèk laperèz; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:24">Nonb 14:24</ref></char></note>Mwen te swiv SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an nèt.” <verse eid="JOS 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 14:9"/>Konsa, Moïse te sèmante nan jou sa a, e li te di: “Vrèman <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:36">Det 1:36</ref></char></note>peyi a sila pye ou te foule a va vin yon eritaj pou ou menm ak pitit ou yo pou tout tan, akoz ou te swiv SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an nèt.”<verse eid="JOS 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 14:10"/>“Koulye a, gade byen, SENYÈ a te kite mwen viv pandan karant-senk ane sa yo, jis jan ke Li te pale a, soti nan tan sila a ke SENYÈ a te pale pawòl sa a Moïse la, lè Israël te mache nan dezè a. Epi koulye a, gade byen, jodi a mwen gen katreven senk ane. <verse eid="JOS 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 14:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 34:7">Det 34:7</ref></char></note>Mwen gen menm fòs jodi a ke m te gen nan jou Moïse te voye mwen an. Tankou fòs mwen te gen nan moman sa a, se konsa fòs mwen ye koulye a, pou fè lagè ak antre sòti. <verse eid="JOS 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 14:12"/>Alò, koulye a, ban m peyi ti kolin yo sa ke SENYÈ a te pale nan jou sa a. Paske ou te tande nan jou sa a ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:33">Nonb 13:33</ref></char></note>Anakim yo te la avèk gran vil byen fòtifye. Li kapab ke SENYÈ a va avè m, e mwen va chase yo sòti ladann jan SENYÈ a te pale a.”<verse eid="JOS 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 14:13"/>Alò, Josué te beni li e te bay Hébron a Caleb, fis a Jephunné a, Kenizyen an jis rive jodi a kon eritaj li. Paske li te swiv SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la nèt. <verse eid="JOS 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 14:14"/>Konsa, Hébron te devni eritaj Caleb, fis a Jephunné, Kenyen nan, jis rive jou sa a, akoz li te swiv SENYÈ a nèt. <verse eid="JOS 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 14:15"/>Alò, non ansyen a Hébron an se te Kirjath-Arba, paske Arba te moun pi gran pami Anakim yo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 14:15">Answit, peyi a te vin gen repo san fè lagè.<verse eid="JOS 14:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOS 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 15:1"/>Koulye a, tiraj <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:3-4">Nonb 34:3-4</ref></char></note>osò a pou tribi fis a Juda yo selon fanmi pa yo te rive nan lizyè Édom an, desann nan sid pou rive nan dezè Tsin nan pwent ki plis nan sid la. <verse eid="JOS 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 15:2"/>Lizyè sid la te sòti nan pwent piba nan Lamè Sale a, soti nan dlo ki vire vè sid la. <verse eid="JOS 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 15:3"/>Konsa, li te kontinye vè sid pou rive nan pant Akrabbim nan. Li te kontinye a Tsin, li te monte vè sid a Kadès-Barnéa, e te kontinye nan Hesbron. Li te monte nan Addar e te vire tounen a Karkaa. <verse eid="JOS 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 15:4"/>Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:5">Nonb 34:5</ref></char></note>pase vè Atsmon e te kontinye pou rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:18">Jen 15:18</ref></char></note>ti rivyè Égypte la. Konsa, lizyè a te fini nan lanmè a. Sa va lizyè sid nou.<verse eid="JOS 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 15:5"/>Lizyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:3-12">Nonb 34:3-12</ref></char></note>lès la te Lamè Sale a soti nan bouch larivyè Jourdain an. Epi lizyè bò kote nò a te soti nan lanmè a nan bouch Jourdain an. <verse eid="JOS 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 15:6"/>Epi lizyè a te monte vè Beth-Hogla, li te kontinye nan kote nò a Beth-Araba, epi lizyè a te monte nan wòch Bohan nan, fis a Ruben an. <verse eid="JOS 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 15:7"/>Lizyè a te monte vè Debir soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:24">Jos 7:24</ref></char></note>vale a Acor a e te vire bò nò a vè Guilgal ki anfas pant pou rive Adummim, ki nan sid vale a, epi lizyè a te kontinye rive jis nan dlo a En-Schémesch pou te fini nan En-Roguel. <verse eid="JOS 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 15:8"/>Konsa, lizyè a te monte nan vale Ben-Hinnon rive nan pant <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:63">Jos 15:63</ref></char></note>Jebizyen nan sid (sa vle di Jérusalem), epi lizyè a te monte sou pwent mòn nan ki pi devan vale Hinnon an vè lwès, ki nan dènye pwent vale Rephaïm nan vè nò. <verse eid="JOS 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 15:9"/>Soti nan tèt mòn nan, lizyè a te koube pou rive nan sous ki rele dlo Nephtoach e te rive devan nan vil a Mòn Éphron an, epi lizyè a te vin koube pou rive nan Baala, (sa vle di, Kirjath-Jearim). <verse eid="JOS 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 15:10"/>Lizyè a te vire soti nan Baala vè lwès pou rive nan Mòn Séir, li te kontinye pou rive nan pant Mòn Jearim nan nò (sa vle di Kesalon). Li te desann nan Beth-Schémesch e li te pase nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:13">Jen 38:13</ref></char></note>Timnah. <verse eid="JOS 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 15:11"/>Lizyè a te kontinye rive akote Ékron vè nò. Epi lizyè a te koube rive nan Schicron, li te kontinye rive jis nan Mòn Baala, li te rive nan Jabneel, e li te fè bout nan lanmè a. <verse eid="JOS 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 15:12"/>Lizyè a nan lwès la te nan kot Gran Lamè a. Sa se lizyè ki antoure fis Juda yo selon fanmi pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 15:13"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:13-15">Jos 14:13-15</ref></char></note>li te bay a Caleb, fis Jephunné a, yon pòsyon pami fis Juda yo, selon kòmand a SENYÈ a vè Josué. Li te kon rele Kirjath-Arba, apre papa Anak (ki anplis kon rele, Hébron). <verse eid="JOS 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 15:14"/>Caleb te chase fè sòti la twa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:33">Nonb 13:33</ref></char></note> fis Anak yo: Schéschaï, Ahiman ak Talmaï, pitit a Anak yo.<verse eid="JOS 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 15:15"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:38">Jos 10:38</ref></char></note>li te monte soti la kont sila ki rete Debir yo. Debir oparavan te rele Kirjath-Sépher. <verse eid="JOS 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 15:16"/>Alò, Caleb te di: “Sila ki kaptire li a, mwen va bay li Acsa, fi mwen an, kòm madanm.” <verse eid="JOS 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 15:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:13">Jij 1:13</ref></char></note>Othniel, fis a Kenaz la, frè Caleb la te kaptire li. Konsa, li te bay li Acsa, fi li a, kòm madanm.<verse eid="JOS 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 15:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 1:14">Jij 1:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Li te vin rive ke lè fi a te vin kote li, li te konvenk li pou mande papa li pou yon chan. Konsa, fi a te desann bourik la, e Caleb te di l: “Kisa ou vle?”<verse eid="JOS 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 15:19"/>Epi li te di: “Beni mwen; Kòmsi, ou te ban mwen tè nan negev la, ban mwen sous dlo yo tou.” Konsa, li te ba li sous pi wo yo avèk sous anba yo.<verse eid="JOS 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 15:20"/>Sa se eritaj a tribi a fis Juda yo selon fanmi pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 15:21"/>Alò, vil nan tribi fis Juda yo, pi lwen vè fwontyè Édom an nan sid la te Kabsteel, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 35:21">Jen 35:21</ref></char></note>Éder, avèk Jagur, <verse eid="JOS 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 15:22"/>epi Kina, Dimona, Adada <verse eid="JOS 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 15:23"/>ak Kédesh, Hatsor, Ithnan, <verse eid="JOS 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 15:24"/>Ziph, Thélem, Bealòth, <verse eid="JOS 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 15:25"/>Hatsor-Hadattha, Kerijoth-Hetsron ki se Hatsor, <verse eid="JOS 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 15:26"/>Amam, Schema, Molada, <verse eid="JOS 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 15:27"/>Hatsar-Gadda, Heschmon, Beth-Paleth, <verse eid="JOS 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 15:28"/>Hatsar-Schual, Beer-Schéba, Bizjothja <verse eid="JOS 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 15:29"/>Baala, Ijjim, Atsem, <verse eid="JOS 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 15:30"/>Eltholad, Kesil, Horma, <verse eid="JOS 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 15:31"/>Tsiklag, Madmanna, Sansanna, <verse eid="JOS 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 15:32"/>Lebaoth, Schilhim, Aïn, avèk Rimmon. Antou, vent-nèf vil avèk bouk pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 15:33"/>Nan ba plèn nan: Eschathaol, Tsorea, Aschna, <verse eid="JOS 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 15:34"/>Zanoach, En-Gannim, Tappuach, Énam, <verse eid="JOS 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 15:35"/>Jarmuth, Adullam, Soco, Azéka, <verse eid="JOS 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 15:36"/>Schaaraïm, Adithaïm, Guedéra, avèk Guedérothaïm; katòz vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 15:37"/>Tsenan, Hadascha, Migdal-Gad, <verse eid="JOS 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 15:38"/>Dilèan, Mitspé, Joktheel, <verse eid="JOS 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 15:39"/>Lakis, Botskath, Églon, <verse eid="JOS 15:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 15:40"/>Cabbon, Lachmas, Kithlisch, <verse eid="JOS 15:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 15:41"/>Guedéroth, Beth-Dagon, Naama, avèk Makkéda; sèz vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 15:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 15:42"/>Libna, Éther, Aschan, <verse eid="JOS 15:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 15:43"/>Jiphatach, Aschna, Netsib, <verse eid="JOS 15:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 15:44"/>Keïla, Aczib ak Maréscha; nèf vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 15:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 15:45"/>Ékron, avèk vil li yo ak bouk pa li yo; <verse eid="JOS 15:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 15:46"/>soti nan Ékron menm pou rive nan lanmè a, tout sa ki te menm kote avèk Asdod avèk bouk pa li yo. <verse eid="JOS 15:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 15:47"/>Asdod, vil pa li yo avèk bouk yo; Gaza, vil pa li yo avèk bouk yo; jis rive nan ti rivyè Égypte la avèk akote Gran Lamè a, menm.<verse eid="JOS 15:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 15:48"/>Nan peyi ti kolin yo: Schamir, Jatthir, Soco, <verse eid="JOS 15:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 15:49"/>Danna, kirjath-Sanna, ki se Debir, <verse eid="JOS 15:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 15:50"/>Anab, Eschthemo, Anim, <verse eid="JOS 15:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 15:51"/>Gosen, Holon, avèk Guilo, onz vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 15:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JOS 15:52"/>Arab, Duma, Éschean <verse eid="JOS 15:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JOS 15:53"/>Janum, Beth-Tappuach, Aphéka, <verse eid="JOS 15:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JOS 15:54"/>Humta, Kirjath-Arba, ki se Hébron, avèk Tsior; nèf vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 15:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JOS 15:55"/>Maon, Carmel, Ziph, Juta, <verse eid="JOS 15:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JOS 15:56"/>Jizreel, Jokdeam, Zanoach, <verse eid="JOS 15:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JOS 15:57"/>Kaïn, Guibea, avèk Thimna; dis vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 15:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JOS 15:58"/>Halhul, Beth-Tsur, Guedor, <verse eid="JOS 15:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JOS 15:59"/>Maarath, Beth-Anoth, avèk Elthekon; sis vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 15:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JOS 15:60"/>Kirjath-Baal, ki se Kirjath-Jearim ak Rabba; de vil avèk bouk pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 15:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JOS 15:61"/>Nan dezè a: Beth-Araba, Middin, Secaca, <verse eid="JOS 15:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JOS 15:62"/>Nibschan, Ir-Hammélach ak En-Guédi; sis vil avèk bouk pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 15:62"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="JOS 15:63"/>Alò, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:21">Jij 1:21</ref></char></note>Jebizyen yo, moun ki te rete Jérusalem yo, fis Juda yo pa t kapab chase yo ale; pou sa, Jebizyen yo rete pami fis Juda yo jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="JOS 15:63"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOS 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 16:1"/>Tiraj osò fis a Joseph yo te sòti nan Jourdain vè Jéricho pou rive nan dlo a Jéricho yo, vè lès nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 8:15">Jos 8:15</ref></char></note>dezè a. Yo te monte soti Jéricho pou pase nan peyi ti kolin yo pou rive Béthel. <verse eid="JOS 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 16:2"/>Li te sòti Béthel vè Luz pou te kontinye rive jis nan fwontyè Akiyen yo nan Atharoth. <verse eid="JOS 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 16:3"/>Li te kouri desann vè lwès nan teritwa a Jafletyen yo, jis rive nan teritwa pati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:13">Jos 18:13</ref></char></note>Beth-Horon ki piba a, jis rive nan Guézer; epi li te fè bout li nan lanmè.<verse eid="JOS 16:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 16:4"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 17:4">Jos 17:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fis a Joseph, Manassé avèk Éphraïm te resevwa eritaj pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 16:5"/>Men teritwa fis a Éphraïm yo selon fanmi pa yo: lizyè a eritaj pa yo, vè lès se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:13">Jos 18:13</ref></char></note>Atharoth-Addar, pou rive nan Wo Beth-Horon. <verse eid="JOS 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 16:6"/>Epi lizyè a te vire nan lwès nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:7">Jos 17:7</ref></char></note>Micmethath nan nò; epi lizyè a te vire vè lès pou Thaanath-Silo e te kouri depase li nan lès a Janoach. <verse eid="JOS 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 16:7"/>Li te vin desann soti nan Janoach a Ataroth, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 7:27">I Kwo 7:27</ref></char></note>Naaratha, li te rive nan Jéricho e te sòti nan Jourdain an. <verse eid="JOS 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 16:8"/>Soti nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:8">Jos 17:8</ref></char></note>Tappuach, lizyè a te kontinye vè lwès nan ti rivyè Kana a e te fè bout li nan lanmè. Sa se te eritaj a tribi fis Éphraïm yo selon fanmi pa yo, <verse eid="JOS 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 16:9"/>avèk vil ki te mete apa pou fis Éphraïm yo nan mitan eritaj a fis Manassé yo, tout vil yo avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 16:10"/>Men yo pa t chase fè sòti Kananeyen ki te rete Guézer yo; epi pou sa, Kananeyen yo rete pami Éphraïm jis jodi a. Konsa, yo te vin ouvriye yo nan travay fòse.<verse eid="JOS 16:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOS 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 17:1"/>Alò, sa se tiraj osò a pou Manassé, paske li te premye ne a Joseph. Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:8">Jos 17:8</ref></char></note>Makir, premye ne a Manassé a, papa a Galaad ak Basan, paske li te yon nonm lagè. <verse eid="JOS 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 17:2"/>Epi tiraj osò a te fèt pou lòt fis Manassé yo selon fanmi pa yo: pou fis a Abiézer a, pou fis a Hélek la, pou fis a Asriel yo, e fis a Sichem yo, pou fis a Hépher yo ak pou fis a Schemida yo; sa yo se te desandan mesye a Manassé yo, fis a Joseph la selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 17:3"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 26:33">Nonb 26:33</ref></char></note> Tselophchad, fis a Hépher a, fis a Galaad la, fis a Makir a, fis a Manassé a, pa t gen fis, men sèlman fi. Sila yo se non a fi li yo: Machla, Noa, Hogla, Milca ak Thirtsa. <verse eid="JOS 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 17:4"/>Yo te vin pwoche Éléazar, prèt la, ak devan Josué, fis a Nun nan, ak devan chèf yo, e yo te di: “SENYÈ a te kòmande Moïse pou bannou yon eritaj pami frè nou yo.” Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:5-7">Nonb 27:5-7</ref></char></note> selon kòmand a SENYÈ a, li te ba yo yon eritaj pami frè a papa pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 17:5"/>Pou sa, te vin tonbe dis pòsyon tè a Manassé, anplis, tout tè a Galaad ak Basan ki lòtbò Jourdain an, <verse eid="JOS 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 17:6"/>akoz fi a Manassé yo te resevwa yon eritaj pami fis li yo. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:30-31">Jos 13:30-31</ref></char></note>tè Galaad la te apatyen a lòt fis Manassé yo. <verse eid="JOS 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 17:7"/>Lizyè Manassé a te kouri soti Aser a Micmethath, ki nan lès a Sichem. Epi lizyè a te kouri vè sid pou rive kote pèp En-Tappuach yo. <verse eid="JOS 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 17:8"/>Tè Tappuach la te apatyen a Manassé; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:8">Jos 16:8</ref></char></note>Tappuach nan lizyè Manassé a te pou fis a Éphraïm yo. <verse eid="JOS 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 17:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:8">Jos 16:8</ref></char></note>Lizyè a te kouri desann rive nan ti rivyè Kana a, bò kote sid a rivyè a (vil sa yo se te pou Éphraïm pami vil a Manassé yo). Epi lizyè a Manassé a te nan kote nò a ti rivyè a e li te fè bout li nan lanmè. <verse eid="JOS 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 17:10"/>Kote sid la se te pou Éphraïm e kote nò a se te pou Manassé, lanmè a te lòt lizyè a. Yo te rive vè Aser nan nò e vè Issacar nan lès. <verse eid="JOS 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 17:11"/>Nan Issacar ak nan Aser, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 7:29">I Kwo 7:29</ref></char></note> Manassé te gen Beth-Schean avèk bouk li yo, Jibleam avèk bouk li yo, pèp a Dor yo avèk bouk li yo, pèp a En-Dor yo avèk bouk li yo, pèp a Thaanac yo avèk bouk li yo, pèp a Meguiddo yo avèk bouk li yo e twazyèm nan se Napheth. <verse eid="JOS 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 17:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:27">Jij 1:27</ref></char></note>Men fis Manassé yo pa t kab pran posesyon a vil sa yo akoz Kananeyen yo te pèsiste viv nan peyi sa a.<verse eid="JOS 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 17:13"/>Li te rive ke lè fis Israël yo te vin gen fòs, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:10">Jos 16:10</ref></char></note>yo te mete Kananeyen yo nan travo fòse; men yo pa t chase yo deyò nèt. <verse eid="JOS 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 17:14"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:7">Nonb 13:7</ref></char></note>fis Joseph yo te pale avèk Josué e te di: “Poukisa mwen te resevwa yon sèl tiraj osò ak yon sèl pòsyon kòm eritaj, paske nou menm se yon pèp ki anpil ke jis koulye a SENYÈ a te beni anpil?”<verse eid="JOS 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 17:15"/>Josué te di yo: “Si nou se yon pèp ki anpil, ale monte nan forè a pou netwaye yon plas pou nou la nan peyi Ferezyen avèk Rephaïm yo; akoz peyi ti kolin Éphraïm nan twò etwat pou nou.”<verse eid="JOS 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 17:16"/>Epi fis Joseph yo te reponn: “Peyi ti kolin nan pa kont pou nou e tout Kananeyen yo ki rete nan plèn nan gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:18">Jos 17:18</ref></char></note>cha ki fèt an fè, ni sila ki nan Beth-Schean avèk bouk pa li yo ak sila ki nan vale Jizreel la.”<verse eid="JOS 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 17:17"/>Josué te pale avèk lakay Joseph, a Éphraïm avèk Manassé e te di: “Nou se yon pèp ki anpil e ki gen gran pouvwa. Nou p ap gen yon sèl tiraj osò, <verse eid="JOS 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 17:18"/>men peyi ti kolin yo va vin pou nou. Men se yon forè ke li ye, nou va eklèsi li e lizyè ki pi lwen nan li yo va vin pou nou; paske nou va chase met deyò Kananeyen yo, malgre yo gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:16">Jos 17:16</ref></char></note>cha ki fèt an fè e malgre yo gen fòs.”<verse eid="JOS 17:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOS 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 18:1"/>Alò, fis Israël yo te vin rasanble yo menm nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 21:19">Jij 21:19</ref></char></note>Silo e te monte tant asanble a. Peyi a te vin soumèt devan yo. <verse eid="JOS 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 18:2"/>Te rete pami fis Israël yo sèt tribi ki potko divize eritaj yo. <verse eid="JOS 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 18:3"/>Konsa, Josué te di a fis Israël yo: “Konbyen de tan nou va mete ankò pou nou pa antre pran posesyon peyi a ke SENYÈ a, Bondye a zansèt nou yo, te bannou an? <verse eid="JOS 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 18:4"/>Bay a tèt nou twa mesye ki sòti nan chak tribi, pou m kapab voye yo e pou yo kab mache nan peyi a, pou ekri yon plan detaye a yo menm selon pwòp eritaj pa yo; epi yo va retounen bò kote mwen. <verse eid="JOS 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 18:5"/>Yo va divize li an sèt pòsyon; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:1">Jos 15:1</ref></char></note>Juda va rete nan teritwa pa li nan sid e lakay Joseph la va rete nan teritwa pa yo nan nò. <verse eid="JOS 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 18:6"/>Nou va fè apantaj peyi a an sèt pòsyon e mennen li ban mwen. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 14:2">Jos 14:2</ref></char></note>Mwen va tire yo osò pou nou isit la devan SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an. <verse eid="JOS 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 18:7"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 18:7-20">Nonb 18:7-20</ref></char></note>Levit yo pa gen pòsyon pami nou, akoz pozisyon prèt SENYÈ a se eritaj pa yo. Gad avèk Ruben avèk mwatye tribi Manassé a, osi, te resevwa eritaj vè lès, lòtbò Jourdain an, ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te ba yo.”<verse eid="JOS 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 18:8"/>Konsa, mesye yo te leve ale. Josué te kòmande sila ki te ale yo: “Ale mache nan teren an, e founi yon plan apantaj detaye de li e retounen kote mwen. Alò, mwen va tire li osò pou nou soti isit la nan Silo.”<verse eid="JOS 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 18:9"/>Konsa, mesye yo te sòti e te pase nan peyi a, yo te fè plan apantaj detaye a. Yo te ekri yon deskripsyon selon vil li yo, sèt divizyon yo nan yon liv. Konsa, yo te retounen vè Josué nan kan an Silo. <verse eid="JOS 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 18:10"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:16-29">Nonb 34:16-29</ref></char></note>Josué te tire yo osò pou yo nan Silo devan SENYÈ a e la, Josué te divize peyi a pou fis Israël yo selon divizyon pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 18:11"/>Alò, tiraj osò a pou tribi Benjamin an te monte selon fanmi pa yo e teritwa osò pa yo a te poze antre fis a Juda yo ak fis a Joseph yo. <verse eid="JOS 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 18:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:1">Jos 16:1</ref></char></note>Lizyè pa yo nan kote nò a te soti nan Jourdain an, lizyè a te monte bò kote Jéricho nan nò, li te pase nan peyi ti kolin yo vè lwès e li te fè bout li nan dezè a Beth-Aven an. <verse eid="JOS 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 18:13"/>Soti la, lizyè a te kouri vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:19">Jen 28:19</ref></char></note>Luz nan kote sid a Luz (ki se Béthel) vè sid; epi lizyè a te desann vè Athroth-Addar, toupre ti mòn ki sou kote sid a Ba Beth-Horon an. <verse eid="JOS 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 18:14"/>Lizyè a te lonje rive e te vire won sou kote lwès la vè sid; soti nan ti mòn ki parèt devan Beth-Horon vè sid; epi li te fè bout li nan Kirjath-Baal (sa vle di Kirjath-Jearim), yon vil a fis a Juda yo. Sa se te kote lwès la. <verse eid="JOS 18:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 18:15"/>Epi kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:5-9">Jos 15:5-9</ref></char></note>sid la te soti akote a Kirjath-Jearim e lizyè a te ale vè lwès pou te rive nan fontèn dlo Nephthoach yo. <verse eid="JOS 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 18:16"/>Lizyè a te kouri desann rive akote ti mòn ki nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:10">II Wa 23:10</ref></char></note>vale Ben-Hinnom, ki nan vale Rephaïm nan vè nò. Epi li te ale desann a vale Hinnom an, nan pant Jebizyen vè sid e te desann jis nan En-Roguel. <verse eid="JOS 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 18:17"/>Li te lonje vè nò e te rive nan En-Schémesch ak nan Gueliloth, ki anfas pant Adummim nan. Epi li te desann nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:6">Jos 15:6</ref></char></note>wòch Bohan an, fis a Ruben an. <verse eid="JOS 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 18:18"/>Li te kontinye akote pa devan Araba a vè nò e te desann rive nan Araba. <verse eid="JOS 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 18:19"/>Lizyè a te kontinye vè akote Beth-Hogla vè nò; epi lizyè a te fè bout li nan dlo nò a Lamè Sale a, nan pwent sid a Rivyè Jourdain an. Sa se te lizyè sid la. <verse eid="JOS 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 18:20"/>Anplis, Jourdain an te lizyè li nan kote lès. Sa se te eritaj a fis Benjamin yo, selon fanmi pa yo ak selon lizyè li yo toupatou. <verse eid="JOS 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 18:21"/>Alò, vil pou tribi a fis Benjamin yo selon fanmi pa yo se te Jéricho, Beth-Hogla, Émek-Ketsits, <verse eid="JOS 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 18:22"/>Beth-Araba, Tsemaraïm, Béthel, <verse eid="JOS 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 18:23"/>Avvim, Para, Ophra, <verse eid="JOS 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 18:24"/>Kephar-Ammonaï, Ophni, epi Guéba; douz vil yo, avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 18:25"/>Gabaon, Rama, Beéroth, <verse eid="JOS 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 18:26"/>Mitspé, Kephira, Motsa, <verse eid="JOS 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 18:27"/>Rékem, Jirpeel, Thareala, <verse eid="JOS 18:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 18:28"/>Tséla, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 21:14">II Sam 21:14</ref></char></note>Éleph, Jebus, ki se Jérusalem, Guibeath ak Kirjath; Sa se eritaj a fis Benjamin yo selon fanmi pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 18:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOS 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 19:1"/>Alò, dezyèm tiraj osò a te tonbe a Siméon, a tribi a fis a Siméon yo selon fanmi pa yo e eritaj pa yo te nan mitan eritaj a fis Juda yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 19:2"/>Konsa, yo te gen kòm eritaj yo Beer-Schéba, Schéba ak Molada, <verse eid="JOS 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 19:3"/>avèk Hatsar-Schual, Bala, Atsem, <verse eid="JOS 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 19:4"/>Eltholad, Bethul, Horma <verse eid="JOS 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 19:5"/>Tsiklag, Beth-Marcaboth, Hatsar-Susa, <verse eid="JOS 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 19:6"/>Beth-Lebaoth ak Scharuchen, trèz vil avèk bouk pa yo; <verse eid="JOS 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 19:7"/>Aïn, Rimmon, Éther ak Aschan, kat vil avèk bouk pa yo; <verse eid="JOS 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 19:8"/>epi tout bouk ki antoure vil sa yo, jis rive nan Baalath-Beer, ki se Ramath a Negev la. Sa se te eritaj a tribi fis a Siméon yo selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 19:9"/>Eritaj a fis Siméon yo te sòti depi nan pòsyon fis Juda yo, paske pòsyon Juda a te twò gran pou yo. Konsa, fis a Siméon yo te resevwa eritaj nan mitan eritaj Juda a.<verse eid="JOS 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 19:10"/>Alò, twazyèm tiraj osò a te monte pou fis Zabulon yo, selon fanmi pa yo. Epi teritwa eritaj pa yo a te rive jis Sarid. <verse eid="JOS 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 19:11"/>Lizyè pa yo a te rive nan lwès jis Mareala e te touche Dabbéscheth pou te rive nan ti rivyè ki devan Jokneam nan. <verse eid="JOS 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 19:12"/>Epi li te vire soti nan Sarid vè lès, vè solèy leve, jis rive nan fwontyè Kisloth-Thabor, kouri rive nan Dabrath e monte a Japhia. <verse eid="JOS 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 19:13"/>Soti la, li te kouri vè lès, vè solèy leve, pou rive Guittha-Hépher, a Ittha-Katsin pou kontinye a Rimmon e lonje jis rive Néa. <verse eid="JOS 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 19:14"/>Lizyè a te koube antoure li vè nò rive nan Hannathon e li te fè bout li nan vale Jiphthach-El. <verse eid="JOS 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 19:15"/>Konte ladann tou, se te Katthath, Nahaial, Schimron, Jideala, Bethléem. Douz vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 19:16"/>Sa se te eritaj a fis Zabulon yo, selon fanmi pa yo, vil sa yo avèk bouk pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 19:17"/>Katriyèm tiraj osò a te tonbe a Issacar; pou fis Issacar yo avèk fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 19:18"/>Teritwa pa yo a te rive Jizreel, avèk Kesulloth ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 28:4">I Sam 28:4</ref></char></note>Sunem, <verse eid="JOS 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 19:19"/>Hapharaïm, Schion, Anacharath, <verse eid="JOS 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 19:20"/>Rabbith, Kischjon, Abets, <verse eid="JOS 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 19:21"/>Rémeth, En-Gannim, En-Hadda, avèk Beth-Patsets: <verse eid="JOS 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 19:22"/>Lizyè a te rive nan Thabor, nan Schachatsima, nan Beth-Schémesch e te fè bout li nan Jourdain an. Sèz vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 19:23"/>Sa se te eritaj a tribi a fis Issacar yo selon fanmi pa yo, vil yo avèk bouk pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 19:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 19:24"/>Alò senkyèm tiraj osò a te tonbe a tribi a fis Aser yo selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 19:25"/>Teritwa pa yo a se te Helkath, Hali, Béthen, Acschaph, <verse eid="JOS 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 19:26"/>Allammélec, Amead avèk Mischeal; li te touche Carmel avèk Schichor-Libnath nan lwès. <verse eid="JOS 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 19:27"/>Li te vire vè lès a Beth-Dagon pou te rive a Zabulon, ak nan vale Jiphthach-El vè nò a Beth-Émek avèk Neïel e kontinye vè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:13">I Wa 9:13</ref></char></note>Cabul, <verse eid="JOS 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 19:28"/>avèk Ébron, Rehob, Hammon, ak Cana, jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 10:19">Jen 10:19</ref></char></note>Gran Sidon. <verse eid="JOS 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 19:29"/>Lizyè a te vin vire vè Rama ak vil fòtifye ki rele Tyr la; epi li vin vire nan Hosa e li te fè bout li nan lanmè vè zòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:31">Jij 1:31</ref></char></note>Aczib. <verse eid="JOS 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 19:30"/>Osi, ladann se te Umma, Aphek, avèk Rehob. Venn-de vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 19:31"/>Sa se te eritaj a tribi fis Aser yo, selon fanmi pa yo, vil sa yo avèk bouk pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 19:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 19:32"/>Sizyèm tiraj osò a te tonbe pou fis Nephtali yo, selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 19:33"/>Lizyè pa yo a te soti nan Héleph, soti nan chèn a Tsaannim nan, Adami-Nékeb ak Jabneel, jis rive nan Lakkum pou li fin fè bout li nan Jourdain an. <verse eid="JOS 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 19:34"/>Epi lizyè a te vire vè lwès nan Aznoth-Thabor pou te kontinye soti la a Hukkok; epi li te rive nan Zabulon vè sid, li te touche Aser sou lwès e Juda bò kote Jourdain an vè lès. <verse eid="JOS 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 19:35"/>Vil fòtifye yo se te Tsiddim, Tser, Hammath, Rakkath, Kinnéreth, <verse eid="JOS 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 19:36"/>Adama, Rama, Hatsor, <verse eid="JOS 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 19:37"/>avèk Kédesch, Édréï, En-Hatsor, <verse eid="JOS 19:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 19:38"/>Jireon, Migdal-El, Horem, Beth-Anath, Beth-Schémesch. Dis-nèf vil avèk bouk pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 19:39"/>Sa se te eritaj a tribi a fis Nephtali yo, selon fanmi pa yo, vil yo avèk bouk pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 19:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 19:40"/>Setyèm tiraj osò a te tonbe a tribi fis a Dan yo selon fanmi pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 19:41"/>Teritwa a eritaj pa yo a se te Tsorea, Eschthaol, Ir-Schémesch, <verse eid="JOS 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 19:42"/>avèk Schaalabbin, Ajalon, Jithla, <verse eid="JOS 19:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 19:43"/>epi Élon, Thiminatha, Ékron, <verse eid="JOS 19:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 19:44"/>Eltheké, Guibbethon, Baalath, <verse eid="JOS 19:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 19:45"/>Jehud, Bené-Berak, Gath-Rimmon, <verse eid="JOS 19:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JOS 19:46"/>Mé-Jarkon ak Rakkon, avèk teritwa ki anfas Japho a. <verse eid="JOS 19:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JOS 19:47"/>Teritwa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:1">Jij 18:1</ref></char></note>fis a Dan yo te ale pi lwen pase yo; paske fis a Dan yo te monte pou te goumen avèk Léschem e te pran li. Epi yo te frape li avèk lam nepe, yo te posede li e te vin abite ladann; epi yo te rele Léschem Dan menm non a Dan, papa pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 19:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JOS 19:48"/>Sa se te eritaj a tribi fis a Dan yo selon fanmi pa yo, vil sila yo avèk bouk pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 19:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JOS 19:49"/>Lè yo te fin divize teren an kòm eritaj selon lizyè li, fis a Israël yo te bay yon eritaj nan mitan yo a Josué, fis a Nun nan. <verse eid="JOS 19:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JOS 19:50"/>An akò avèk kòmand SENYÈ a, yo te ba li vil ke li te mande a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 13:8">Nonb 13:8</ref></char></note>Thimnath-Sérach nan peyi ti mòn a Éphraïm nan. Konsa, li te bati vil la e li te abite ladann. <verse eid="JOS 19:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JOS 19:51"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:10">Jos 18:10</ref></char></note>Sila yo se te eritaj ke Éléazar, prèt la, ak Josué, fis a Nun nan, ak chèf an tèt kay a tribi yo pou fis Israël yo te separe pa tiraj osò nan Silo devan SENYÈ a, nan pòtay tant asanble a. Konsa, yo te fin divize peyi a.<verse eid="JOS 19:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOS 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 20:1"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te pale a Josué e te di: <verse eid="JOS 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 20:2"/>“Pale a fis Israël yo e di: ‘Etabli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:6-34">Nonb 35:6-34</ref></char></note>vil azil ke M te pale ou pa Moïse yo, <verse eid="JOS 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 20:3"/>pou moun ki touye nenpòt moun san li pa fè eksprè, san reflechi yo, pou yo kapab sove ale rive la. Yo va vin yon azil kont vanjè san an. <verse eid="JOS 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 20:4"/>Li va sove ale rive nan youn nan vil sila yo. Yo va kanpe nan antre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 4:1">Rt 4:1</ref></char></note>pòtay a vil sa a pou pwononse ka li a pou ansyen yo nan vil la tande. Konsa, yo va fè l antre nan vil kote yo a, yo va ba li yon kote pou li kapab rete pami yo. <verse eid="JOS 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 20:5"/>Alò, si <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:12">Nonb 35:12</ref></char></note>vanjè san an vin kouri dèyè li, yo pa pou livre moun ki touye moun nan nan men yo, akoz li te frape vwazen li an san reflechi e li pa t rayi li avan lè. <verse eid="JOS 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 20:6"/>Li va rete nan vil sa a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:12">Nonb 35:12</ref></char></note>jiskaske li kanpe devan asanble a pou jijman, jiska lanmò a wo prèt la nan jou epòk sa a. Epi moun ki te touye moun nan va retounen nan pwòp vil pa li ak pwòp kay pa li, nan vil sila li te sove ale a.’”<verse eid="JOS 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 20:7"/>Konsa, yo te mete akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:32">Jos 21:32</ref></char></note>Kédesh nan Galilée nan peyi ti kolin yo a Nephtali, Sichem nan peyi ti kolin yo a Éphraïm ak Kirjath-Arba (sa vle di, Hébron) nan peyi ti kolin Juda a. <verse eid="JOS 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 20:8"/>Lòtbò Jourdain an, sòti Jéricho vè lès, yo te dezinye Betser nan dezè a sou plèn nan pou tribi Ruben an, Ramoth nan Galaad pou tribi Gad la ak Golan nan Basan pou tribi Manassé a. <verse eid="JOS 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 20:9"/>Sila yo se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:13">Nonb 35:13</ref></char></note>vil yo chwazi pou tout fis Israël yo, pou etranje ki demere pami yo, pou nenpòt moun ki touye yon moun san eksprè, kapab sove ale rive la e pa mouri pa men a vanjè san an jiskaske li vin kanpe devan asanble a.<verse eid="JOS 20:9"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOS 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 21:1"/>Epi chèf lakay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:1-8">Nonb 35:1-8</ref></char></note>Levit yo te pwoche Éléazar, prèt la, ak Josué, fis a Nun nan, ak tèt lakay a tribi fis Israël yo. <verse eid="JOS 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 21:2"/>Yo te pale avèk yo Silo, nan peyi Canaan an, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 35:2">Nonb 35:2</ref></char></note>“SENYÈ a te kòmande pa Moïse pou bannou vil pou viv ladann, avèk patiraj pou bèt nou yo.”<verse eid="JOS 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 21:3"/>Konsa, fis Israël yo te bay Levit yo soti nan eritaj pa yo vil sila yo avèk tè patiraj yo selon kòmand SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JOS 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 21:4"/>Epi tiraj osò a te sòti pou fanmi a Keatit yo. Epi fis a Aaron yo, prèt la, ki te apatyen a Levit yo, te resevwa trèz vil pa tiraj osò soti nan tribi Juda, nan tribi Siméon, ak nan tribi Benjamin. <verse eid="JOS 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 21:5"/>Rès nan fis Keatit yo te resevwa dis vil pa tiraj osò soti nan fanmi a tribi a Éphraïm yo, soti nan tribi a Dan lan ak nan mwatye tribi a Manassé a. <verse eid="JOS 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 21:6"/>Fis a Guerschon yo te resevwa trèz vil pa tiraj osò soti nan fanmi a tribi Issacar a, nan tribi Aser a, nan tribi Nephtali a ak nan mwatye tribi Manassé a nan Basan. <verse eid="JOS 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 21:7"/>Fis a Merari yo selon fanmi pa yo te resevwa douz vil soti nan tribi Ruben, soti nan tribi Gad ak soti nan tribi Zabulon. <verse eid="JOS 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 21:8"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 49:5">Jen 49:5</ref></char></note>fis Israël yo te bay selon tiraj osò a Levit yo, vil sila yo avèk teren patiraj pa yo, jan SENYÈ a te kòmande pa Moïse la. <verse eid="JOS 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 21:9"/>Yo te bay vil sila ki mansyone pa non soti nan tribi a fis Juda yo e soti nan tribi a fis Siméon yo; <verse eid="JOS 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 21:10"/>epi yo te pou fis Aaron yo, youn nan fanmi a Keatit yo, nan fis Levi yo; paske premye tiraj osò a se te pou yo. <verse eid="JOS 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 21:11"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:55">I Kwo 6:55</ref></char></note>yo te ba yo Kirjath-Arba, Arba ki te papa a Anak (ki vle di Hébron), nan peyi ti kolin yo nan Juda, avèk teren patiraj ki te antoure li yo. <verse eid="JOS 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 21:12"/>Men chan a vil avèk bouk li yo, yo te bay yo a Caleb, fis a Jephunné a, kòm posesyon pa l. <verse eid="JOS 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 21:13"/>Konsa, a fis Aaron yo, prèt la, yo te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:54">Jos 15:54</ref></char></note>Hébron, vil azil pou moun ki touye moun yo, avèk teren patiraj pa li yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:42">Jos 15:42</ref></char></note>Libna avèk teren patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 21:14"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:48">Jos 15:48</ref></char></note>Jatthir avèk teren patiraj pa li, Eschthemoa avèk teren patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 21:15"/>epi Holon avèk teren patiraj pa li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:49">Jos 15:49</ref></char></note>Debir avèk teren patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 21:16"/>epi Aïn avèk teren patiraj pa li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:10">Jos 15:10</ref> </char></note>Jutta avèk teren patiraj pa li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:55">Jos 15:55</ref></char></note>Beth-Schémesch avèk teren patiraj pa li; nèf vil soti nan de tribi sila yo. <verse eid="JOS 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 21:17"/>Soti nan tribi Benjamin an, Gabaon avèk teren patiraj pa li ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:24">Jos 18:24</ref></char></note>Guéba avèk teren patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 21:18"/>Anathoth avèk teren patiraj pa li ak Almon avèk teren patiraj pa li; kat vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 21:19"/>Tout vil a fis Aaron yo, prèt yo, te trèz vil avèk teren patiraj pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 21:20"/>Epi vil yo soti nan tribi Éphraïm nan te sòt tonbe pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:66">I Kwo 6:66</ref></char></note>fanmi a Kehath yo, Levit yo, jis rive nan lòt fis a Kehath yo. <verse eid="JOS 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 21:21"/>Yo te bay yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:7">Jos 20:7</ref></char></note>Sichem, vil azil pou moun ki touye moun yo, avèk teren patiraj pa li, nan peyi ti kolin yo a Éphraïm ak Guézer avèk teren patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 21:22"/>epi Kibtsaïm avèk teren patiraj pa li, Beth-Horon avèk teren patiraj pa li, Guibbethon avèk teren patiraj pa li; kat vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 21:23"/>Soti nan tribi Dan nan, Eltheke avèk teren patiraj pa li, Guibbethon avèk teren patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 21:24"/>Ajalon avèk teren patiraj pa li, Gath-Rimmon avèk teren patiraj pa li; kat vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 21:25"/>Soti nan mwatye tribi Mannassé a, Thaanac avèk teren patiraj pa li ak Gath-Rimmon avèk teren patiraj pa li; de vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 21:26"/>Tout vil yo avèk teren patiraj pa yo pou fanmi a lòt fis a Kehath yo te dis.<verse eid="JOS 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 21:27"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 6:71">I Kwo 6:71</ref>
      </char>
    </note>A fis Guerschon yo, youn nan fanmi a Levit yo soti nan mwatye tribi Manassé a, te tonbe Golan nan Basan, vil azil pou moun ki touye moun yo, avèk teren patiraj pa li ak Beeschthra avèk teren patiraj pa li; de vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 21:28"/>Soti nan tribi Issacar, Kischjon avèk teren patiraj pa li, Dabrath avèk patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 21:29"/>Jarmuth avèk patiraj pa li, En-Gannim avèk patiraj pa li; kat vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 21:30"/>Soti nan tribi Aser, Mischal avèk teren patiraj pa li ak Abdon avèk teren patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 21:31"/>Helkath avèk teren patiraj pa li ak Rehob avèk patiraj pa li; kat vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 21:32"/>Soti nan tribi Nephtali, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 20:7">Jos 20:7</ref></char></note>Kédesch nan Galilée, vil azil pou moun ki touye moun yo, avèk patiraj pa li ak Hammoth-Dor avèk patiraj pa li; twa vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 21:33"/>Tout vil a Gèchonit yo, selon fanmi pa yo te trèz vil avèk teren patiraj pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 21:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 21:34"/>A fanmi a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:77">I Kwo 6:77</ref></char></note>fis Merari yo, rès nan Levit yo, soti nan tribi Zabulon, Jokneam avèk patiraj pa li ak Kartha avèk patiraj pa li. <verse eid="JOS 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOS 21:35"/>Dimna avèk patiraj pa li, Nahalal avèk patiraj pa li, kat vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOS 21:36"/>Soti nan tribi Ruben an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:43">Det 4:43</ref></char></note>Betser avèk patiraj pa li ak Jahtsa avèk patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOS 21:37"/>Kedémonth avèk teren patiraj pa li ak Méphaath avèk teren patiraj pa li; kat vil. <verse eid="JOS 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOS 21:38"/>Soti nan tribi Gad la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:43">Det 4:43</ref></char></note>Ramoth nan Galaad, vil azil la ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:2">Jen 32:2</ref></char></note>Mahanaïm avèk teren patiraj pa li, <verse eid="JOS 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOS 21:39"/>Hesbon, avèk teren patiraj pa li, Jaezer avèk teren patiraj pa li; kat vil antou. <verse eid="JOS 21:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOS 21:40"/>Tout sila yo te vil a fis Merari yo selon fanmi pa yo, rès a fanmi a Levit yo. Tiraj osò pa yo a te douz vil.<verse eid="JOS 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOS 21:41"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 35:7">Nonb 35:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Tout vil a Levit ki te nan mitan posesyon a fis Israël yo te karann-tuit vil avèk teren patiraj pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 21:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JOS 21:42"/>Chak nan vil sila yo te gen teren patiraj pa li ki te antoure li. Se konsa li te ye avèk tout vil sila yo.<verse eid="JOS 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JOS 21:43"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:43 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 34:4">Det 34:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, SENYÈ a te bay Israël tout peyi ke Li te sèmante pou bay a zansèt pa yo, e yo te posede li pou viv ladann. <verse eid="JOS 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JOS 21:44"/>Epi SENYÈ a te ba yo repo toupatou, selon tout sa ke Li te sèmante a zansèt pa yo e nanpwen youn nan lènmi yo ki te kanpe devan yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:31">Egz 23:31</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te mete tout lènmi yo nan men yo. <verse eid="JOS 21:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JOS 21:45"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:14">Jos 23:14</ref></char></note>Pa menm youn nan bon pwomès ke SENYÈ a te fè kay Israël la pa t manke akonpli. Yo tout te vin rive.<verse eid="JOS 21:45"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOS 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 22:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 32:20-22">Nonb 32:20-22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Josué te rele tout Ribenit yo ak Gadit yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé a. <verse eid="JOS 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 22:2"/>Li te di yo: “Nou te swiv tout sa ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te kòmande nou an <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:12-18">Jos 1:12-18</ref></char></note>e nou te koute vwa m nan tout sa ke m te kòmande nou yo. <verse eid="JOS 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 22:3"/>Nou pa t abandone frè nou yo pandan tout jou sila yo, jis rive jodi a, men nou te kenbe lòd a kòmandman a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an. <verse eid="JOS 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 22:4"/>Epi koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:18">Nonb 32:18</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, te bay repo a frè nou yo, jan Li fenk pale yo a. Pou sa, vire koulye a e ale nan tant pa nou yo, nan peyi posesyon pa nou an, ke Moïse, sèvitè Bondye a, te bannou lòtbò Jourdain an. <verse eid="JOS 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 22:5"/>Sèlman, fè atansyon pou swiv kòmandman an ak lalwa ke Moïse, sèvitè SENYÈ a, te kòmande nou an, pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:10">Det 5:10</ref></char></note>renmen SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, epi mache nan tout chemen Li yo, kenbe kòmandman Li yo, kenbe fèm a Li menm, e sèvi Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:29">Det 4:29</ref></char></note>avèk tout kè nou e ak tout nanm nou.”<verse eid="JOS 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 22:6"/>Epi Josué te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:7">Jen 47:7</ref></char></note>beni yo. Li te voye yo ale, e yo te ale nan pwòp tant pa yo. <verse eid="JOS 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 22:7"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:33">Nonb 32:33</ref></char></note>a mwatye tribi sila ki te pou Manassé a, Moïse te ba yo yon posesyon nan Basan; men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 17:1-13">Jos 17:1-13</ref></char></note>a lòt la, Josué te ba yo yon posesyon pami frè yo nan lwès lòtbò Jourdain an. Konsa, lè Josué te voye yo ale nan tant yo, li te beni yo, <verse eid="JOS 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 22:8"/>epi li te di yo: “Retounen vè tant nou yo avèk gran richès, avèk yon gran kantite bèt, avèk ajan, lò, bwonz, fè, e avèk anpil rad. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 31:27">Nonb 31:27</ref></char></note>Divize piyaj a lènmi nou yo avèk frè nou.”<verse eid="JOS 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 22:9"/>Fis a Ruben yo ak fis a Gad yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé a te retounen kite fis Israël yo nan Silo, ki te nan peyi Canaan an, pou ale nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 32:1-29">Nonb 32:1-29</ref></char></note>peyi Galaad, nan peyi ke yo te posede a, selon kòmand a SENYÈ a ki te soti nan Moïse la.<verse eid="JOS 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 22:10"/>Lè yo te vini nan rejyon Jourdain an, ki nan peyi Canaan an, fis a Ruben yo avèk fis a Gad yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé a te bati yon lotèl la akote Jourdain an, yon lotèl ki parèt byen gran. <verse eid="JOS 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 22:11"/>Lè fis Israël yo te tande afè sa a, yo te di: “Gade byen, fis Ruben yo ak fis Gad yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé a gen tan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5">Det 12:5</ref></char></note>bati yon lotèl nan fwontyè peyi Canaan an, nan rejyon Jourdain an, sou bò ki pou fis Israël yo.” <verse eid="JOS 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 22:12"/>Lè fis Israël yo te vin tande sa a, tout asanble a fis Israël yo te rasanble yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">Jos 18:1</ref></char></note>Silo pou monte kont yo nan lagè. <verse eid="JOS 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 22:13"/>Alò, fis Israël yo te voye prèt la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:7-11">Nonb 25:7-11</ref></char></note>Phinées, fis Éléazar a, kote fis Ruben yo avèk fis Gad yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé a pou antre nan peyi Galaad la. <verse eid="JOS 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 22:14"/>Ansanm avèk li, dis chèf yo, yon chèf pou kay a chak fanmi zansèt nan tribi Israël yo; epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 1:4">Nonb 1:4</ref></char></note> yo chak se te tèt an chèf kay fanmi zansèt li pami milye an Israël yo. <verse eid="JOS 22:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 22:15"/>Yo te vin kote fis Ruben yo, kote fis Gad yo ak kote mwatye tribi Manassé a, nan peyi Galaad la. Yo te pale avèk yo e te di: <verse eid="JOS 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 22:16"/>“Konsa pale tout kongregasyon a SENYÈ a: ‘Ki zak movèz fwa sa ye ke nou te komèt kont Bondye Israël la? Poukisa nou vire kite chemen SENYÈ a jodi a pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:11">Jos 22:11</ref></char></note>bati yon lotèl pou fè rebèl kont SENYÈ a jodi a? <verse eid="JOS 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 22:17"/>Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 25:1-9">Nonb 25:1-9</ref></char></note>inikite Peor a pa t sifi pou nou, nan sila nou poko pwòp jis rive jodi a, sepandan yon epidemi te vin parèt sou asanble SENYÈ a, <verse eid="JOS 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 22:18"/>ke nou bezwen vire kite Jodi a chemen SENYÈ a? Si nou fè rebèl kont SENYÈ a Jodi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:22">Nonb 16:22</ref></char></note>Li va fache avèk tout asanble Israël la demen. <verse eid="JOS 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 22:19"/>Si, malgre sa, peyi posesyon nou an pa pwòp, alò, travèse antre nan peyi posesyon SENYÈ a, kote tabènak SENYÈ a kanpe a pou vin pran posesyon pami nou. Sèlman, pa fè rebèl kont SENYÈ a, ni fè rebèl kont nou avèk lotèl ke nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:11">Jos 22:11</ref></char></note>bati pou kont nou an, anplis ke lotèl SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an. <verse eid="JOS 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 22:20"/>Èske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:1-26">Jos 7:1-26</ref></char></note>Acan, fis Zérach la, pa t aji an movèz fwa nan zafè bagay ki te dedye anba ve a e kòlè te tonbe sou tout asanble a SENYÈ a? Epi se pa mesye sa a sèl ki te peri nan inikite l la.’”<verse eid="JOS 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 22:21"/>Epi fis Ruben yo ak fis Gad yo ak mwatye tribi Manassé a te reponn e te pale avèk chèf an tèt fanmi a Israël yo. <verse eid="JOS 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 22:22"/>Sila ki Toupwisan an, Bondye SENYÈ a, Sila ki Toupwisan an, Bondye SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:39">I Wa 8:39</ref></char></note>Li menm ki konnen! E Li menm va kite Israël konnen tou a. Si se te nan rebelyon, oswa si se nan movèz fwa, yon zak ki fèt kont SENYÈ a, pa sove lavi nou jodi a! <verse eid="JOS 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 22:23"/>Si nou bati pou kont nou yon lotèl pou detounen pa swiv SENYÈ a, oswa si pou nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:11">Det 12:11</ref></char></note>ofri yon ofrann brile, oswa yon ofrann sereyal sou li, oswa si se pou ofri sakrifis lapè sou li, ke SENYÈ a, li menm, fè demann sa a.<verse eid="JOS 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 22:24"/>“Men anverite, si nou pa t fè sa avèk lakrent Bondye avèk yon bi ki te di ke: ‘Nan tan k ap vini an, fis ou yo kapab di a fis nou yo: “Ki relasyon nou gen avèk SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la? <verse eid="JOS 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 22:25"/>Paske SENYÈ a te fè Jourdain nan yon lizyè antre nou ak ou, nou menm, fis a Ruben yo ak fis a Gad yo. Nou pa gen pòsyon nan SENYÈ a.”’” Pou sa a, li ta kab fèt ke fis ou yo ta ka petet fè pitit pa nou vin pa gen krent SENYÈ a.<verse eid="JOS 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 22:26"/>“Pou sa, nou te di: ‘Annou bati yon lotèl, pa pou ofrann brile ni pou sakrifis; <verse eid="JOS 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 22:27"/>men sa va pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:48">Jen 31:48</ref></char></note>yon temwen antre nou avèk ou menm ak antre jenerasyon ki swiv nou yo, ke nou kapab fè sèvis SENYÈ a devan Li avèk ofrann brile nou, avèk sakrifis nou yo e avèk ofrann lapè nou yo;’ pou fis pa w yo pa vin di a fis pa nou yo nan tan ki pou vini an: ‘Nou pa gen pòsyon nan SENYÈ a.’<verse eid="JOS 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 22:28"/>“Pou sa, nou te di, ‘Li va osi vin rive ke si yo di sa a nou, oswa a jenerasyon nou k ap vini an, alò nou va di: “Nou wè modèl lotèl ke zansèt nou yo te fè a, pa pou ofrann brile, ni pou fè sakrifis; men olye de sa, li se yon temwen antre nou menm ak ou menm.”’<verse eid="JOS 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 22:29"/>Lwen de nou ke nou ta fè rebèl kont SENYÈ a pou vin detounen pa swiv SENYÈ a jodi a, pou nou ta <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:13">Det 12:13</ref></char></note>bati yon lotèl ofrann brile, oswa ofrann sereyal, oswa sakrifis, ot ke lotèl ki pou SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, ki devan tabènak pa Li a!”<verse eid="JOS 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 22:30"/>Lè Phinées, prèt la, avèk chèf asanble yo, menm chèf an tèt a fanmi zansèt Israël ki te avèk li yo, te tande pawòl ke fis Ruben yo, fis Gad yo ak fis Manassé yo te pale, sa te fè kè yo kontan. <verse eid="JOS 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 22:31"/>Phinées, fis a Éléazar a, prèt la, te di a fis Ruben yo, fis Gad yo ak fis Manassé yo: “Jodi a, nou konnen ke SENYÈ a pami nou, akoz nou pa t fè zak malonèt sila a kont SENYÈ a. Koulye a, nou gen tan livre fis Israël yo soti nan men SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="JOS 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 22:32"/>Alò, Phinées, fis a Éléazar a, prèt la, avèk chèf yo te retounen sòti nan fis Ruben yo ak nan fis Gad yo, nan peyi Galaad la, yo te rive nan peyi Canaan an vè fis Israël yo e te pote pawòl sa ba yo. <verse eid="JOS 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 22:33"/>Pawòl la te fè kè kontan pami fis Israël yo, e fis Israël yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:20">I Kwo 29:20</ref></char></note>beni Bondye. Yo pa t pale ankò afè fè lagè pou detwi peyi kote fis a Ruben yo avèk fis a Gad yo te rete a. <verse eid="JOS 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOS 22:34"/>Fis a Ruben yo avèk fis a Gad yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:47-49">Jen 31:47-49</ref></char></note>rele lotèl la “Temwen lan Antre Nou, ke SENYÈ a Se Bondye.”<verse eid="JOS 22:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOS 23"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 23:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive apre anpil jou, lè SENYÈ a te bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:44">Jos 21:44</ref></char></note>repo a Israël kont tout lènmi yo nan tout kote, e Josué te vin vye, avanse nan laj, <verse eid="JOS 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 23:2"/>ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:1">Jos 24:1</ref></char></note>Josué te rele tout Israël, tout ansyen yo avèk chèf an tèt yo avèk jij yo ak ofisye yo. Li te di yo: “Mwen vin vye, avanse nan laj. <verse eid="JOS 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 23:3"/>Konsa, nou te wè tout sa ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, te fè a tout nasyon sila yo akoz nou menm. Paske se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:30">Det 1:30</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, ki t ap goumen pou nou an. <verse eid="JOS 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 23:4"/>Nou wè, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:30">Egz 23:30</ref></char></note>mwen te apòsyone pou nou nasyon sila ki rete yo kòm eritaj pou tribi nou yo, avèk tout nasyon ke mwen te koupe retire nèt yo, soti nan Jourdain an jis rive nan Gran Lamè a vè solèy kouche. <verse eid="JOS 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 23:5"/>SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, li va pouse yo sòti devan nou e chase yo soti pou nou pa wè yo. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 33:53">Nonb 33:53</ref></char></note>nou va posede peyi yo, jis jan ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, te pwomèt nou an.<verse eid="JOS 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 23:6"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 5:32">Det 5:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pou sa, Kenbe fèm! Sonje e fè tout sa ki ekri nan liv lalwa Moïse la, pou nou pa vire akote li, ni adwat, ni agoch. <verse eid="JOS 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 23:7"/>Ke nou pa asosye avèk nasyon sila yo, sila ki toujou rete pami nou yo, ni nonmen non a dye pa yo, ni fè pèsòn sèmante pa yo, ni <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Egz 20:5</ref></char></note>sèvi yo, ni bese devan yo. <verse eid="JOS 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 23:8"/>Men nou dwe kenbe fèm a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, jis jan ke nou te fè jis Jodi a.<verse eid="JOS 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 23:9"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:23-30">Egz 23:23-30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Paske SENYÈ a te chase deyò, nasyon ki gran e ki gen fòs soti devan nou. Epi pou nou menm, nanpwen pèsòn ki te konn kanpe devan nou jis Jodi a. <verse eid="JOS 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 23:10"/>Youn nan moun pa nou yo va fè yon milye sove ale; paske SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:22">Det 3:22</ref></char></note>Li menm ki goumen pou nou jan Li te pwomèt nou an. <verse eid="JOS 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 23:11"/>Pou sa, veye tèt nou anpil pou nou renmen SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an.<verse eid="JOS 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 23:12"/>Paske si nou janm retounen pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-16">Egz 34:15-16</ref></char></note>kole a lòt nasyon sila yo, sila ki rete toujou pami nou yo, e vin fè maryaj avèk yo, pou nou vin nan relasyon avèk yo, e yo menm avèk nou, <verse eid="JOS 23:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 23:13"/>konnen, anverite, ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, p ap kontinye chase nasyon sila yo sòti devan nou; men yo va vin yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:33">Egz 23:33</ref></char></note>pèlen ak yon pyèj pou nou, yon frèt bò kote nou ak pikan nan zye nou, jiskaske nou peri sòti nan bon peyi sa a ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, te bannou an.<verse eid="JOS 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 23:14"/>Alò, gade, jodi a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:2">I Wa 2:2</ref></char></note>mwen ap fè chemen ki oblije fèt pou tout tè a. Konsa, nou konnen nan tout kè nou ak nan tout nanm nou, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 21:45">Jos 21:45</ref></char></note>pa menm yon mo nan tout pawòl ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, te pale konsènan nou menm pa t manke akonpli. Tout te vin akonpli pou nou. Pa youn nan yo pa t manke. <verse eid="JOS 23:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 23:15"/>Li va vin rive a nou menm ke menm jan tout bon bagay ke SENYÈ a Bondye nou an te pale de nou te vin rive, ke menm jan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:14-33">Lev 26:14-33</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a va mennen fè rive sou nou tout menas, jiskaske Li fin detwi nou e fè nou sòti nèt nan bon peyi sa a ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, te bannou an, <verse eid="JOS 23:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 23:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:25-26">Det 4:25-26</ref></char></note>si nou transgrese akò a SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, ke Li te kòmande nou an, pou ale sèvi lòt dye yo e bese devan yo. Konsa, kòlè Bondye va brile kont nou e nou va peri vit, pou nou kite bon peyi ke Li te bannou an.”<verse eid="JOS 23:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOS 24"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOS 24:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 23:2">Jos 23:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Josué te rasanble tout tribi Israël yo nan Sichem. Li te rele ansyen Israël yo, chèf an tèt pa yo, jij pa yo ak ofisye pa yo. Yo te prezante yo menm devan Bondye. <verse eid="JOS 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOS 24:2"/>Josué te di a tout pèp la: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: ‘Depi nan tan ansyen yo, zansèt nou yo te viv lòtbò Rivyè a. Menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:27-32">Jen 11:27-32</ref></char></note>Térach, papa Abraham nan, ak papa a Nachor, te sèvi lòt dye yo. <verse eid="JOS 24:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOS 24:3"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Jen 12:1</ref></char></note>Mwen te pran zansèt nou an, Abraham, pou l soti lòtbò Rivyè a. Mwen te mennen li pase nan tout peyi a Canaan yo. Mwen te miltipliye desandan li yo e te bay li Isaac. <verse eid="JOS 24:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOS 24:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:25-26">Jen 25:25-26</ref></char></note>A Isaac, Mwen te bay Jacob avèk Ésaü. A Ésaü, Mwen te bay Mòn Séir pou posede l, men Jacob avèk fis li yo te desann an Égypte.<verse eid="JOS 24:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOS 24:5"/>“‘Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 4:14-17">Egz 4:14-17</ref></char></note> Mwen te voye Moïse avèk Aaron pou te toumante Égypte pa sa Mwen te fè nan mitan li yo. Epi apre, Mwen te mennen nou sòti. <verse eid="JOS 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOS 24:6"/>Mwen te mennen zansèt nou yo sòti an Égypte, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:2-31">Egz 14:2-31</ref></char></note>nou te rive bò kote lanmè a. Konsa, Égypte te kouri dèyè zansèt nou yo avèk cha ak sòlda sou cheval yo jis rive nan Lamè Wouj la. <verse eid="JOS 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOS 24:7"/>Men lè yo te kriye vè SENYÈ a, Li te mete tenèb antre nou menm avèk Ejipsyen yo. Mwen te mennen lanmè a sou yo pou te kouvri yo, epi pwòp zye pa nou te wè sa Mwen te fè an Égypte. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 1:45">Det 1:45</ref></char></note>nou te viv nan dezè a pandan anpil tan.<verse eid="JOS 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOS 24:8"/>“‘Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:21-32">Nonb 21:21-32</ref></char></note>Mwen te mennen nou antre nan peyi Amoreyen ki te rete lòtbò Jourdain an. Yo te goumen avèk nou, epi Mwen te livre yo nan men nou. Nou te pran posesyon a peyi pa yo a e Mwen te detwi yo devan nou. <verse eid="JOS 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOS 24:9"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:2-6">Nonb 22:2-6</ref></char></note>Balak, fis Tsippor a, wa Moab la, te leve pou te goumen kont Israël, e li te voye rele Balaam, fis a Beor a, pou modi nou. <verse eid="JOS 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOS 24:10"/>Men Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:5">Det 23:5</ref></char></note>pa t dakò koute Balaam. Konsa, li te oblije beni nou, e Mwen te delivre nou soti nan men li.<verse eid="JOS 24:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOS 24:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Jos 3:14-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“‘Nou te travèse Jourdain an pou te rive Jéricho, epi pèp Jéricho yo te goumen kont nou; Amoreyen yo, Ferezyen yo, Kananeyen yo avèk Etyen yo avèk Gigazyen yo, Evyen yo ak Jebizyen yo. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:31">Egz 23:31</ref></char></note>Mwen te livre yo nan men nou. <verse eid="JOS 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOS 24:12"/>Apre, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:28">Egz 23:28</ref></char></note>te voye gèp la devan nou e li te chase fè sòti wa Amoreyen yo devan nou, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:3">Sòm 44:3</ref></char></note>pa akoz nepe nou ni banza nou. <verse eid="JOS 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOS 24:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:10">Det 6:10</ref></char></note>Mwen te bannou yon peyi pou sila nou pa t travay, vil ke nou pa t bati e nou te viv ladan yo. N ap manje nan chan rezen avèk chan doliv ke nou pa t plante.’<verse eid="JOS 24:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOS 24:14"/>“Koulye a, pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:12">Det 10:12</ref></char></note>gen lakrent SENYÈ a e sèvi Li avèk bon kè ak verite. Mete akote dye ke zansèt nou yo te konn sèvi lòtbò Rivyè a ak an Égypte pou sèvi SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JOS 24:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOS 24:15"/>Si nou twouve li degoutan nan zye nou pou sèvi SENYÈ a, chwazi pou kont nou jodi a, kilès nou va sèvi; si se dye ke zansèt nou yo te konn sèvi lòtbò Rivyè a, oswa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:10">Jij 6:10</ref></char></note>dye a Amoreyen yo, de peyi sila nou ap viv yo. Men pou mwen avèk lakay mwen, nou va sèvi SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="JOS 24:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOS 24:16"/>Pèp la te reponn e te di: “Se lwen de nou pou nou ta abandone SENYÈ a pou sèvi lòt dye yo; <verse eid="JOS 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOS 24:17"/>paske SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, se Li ki te mennen nou avèk zansèt nou yo monte sòti nan peyi Égypte la, soti nan kay esklavaj la, ki te fè gwo sign sila yo nan mitan nou. Se Li ki te pwoteje nou nan tout chemen kote nou pase e pami tout pèp nan mitan a sila nou te pase yo. <verse eid="JOS 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOS 24:18"/>SENYÈ a te pouse fè sòti devan nou tout pèp yo, menm Amoreyen ki te viv nan peyi a. Konsa, nou osi, nou va sèvi SENYÈ a; paske se Li menm ki Dye nou.”<verse eid="JOS 24:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOS 24:19"/>Alò, Josué te di a pèp la: “Nou p ap kapab sèvi SENYÈ a, paske Li se yon Bondye ki sen. Li se <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Egz 20:5</ref></char></note>yon Bondye ki jalou. Li p ap padone transgresyon nou yo oswa peche nou yo. <verse eid="JOS 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOS 24:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:25-26">Det 4:25-26</ref></char></note>Si nou abandone SENYÈ a pou sèvi dye etranje yo; alò, Li va vire fè nou mal e vin manje nou nèt apre Li te fin fè nou byen.”<verse eid="JOS 24:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOS 24:21"/>Pèp la te di a Josué: “Non, men nou va sèvi SENYÈ a.” <verse eid="JOS 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOS 24:22"/>Josué te di a pèp la: “Nou se temwen kont pwòp tèt nou ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:173">Sòm 119:173</ref></char></note>nou te chwazi pou kont nou SENYÈ a, pou sèvi Li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOS 24:22">Yo te reponn: “Nou se temwen.”<verse eid="JOS 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOS 24:23"/>“Koulye a, pou sa, mete akote dye etranje ki nan mitan nou yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:57-58">I Wa 8:57-58</ref></char></note>tounen kè nou vè SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la.”<verse eid="JOS 24:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOS 24:24"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:8">Egz 19:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Pèp la te di a Josué: “Nou va sèvi SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an e nou va obeyi vwa Li.”<verse eid="JOS 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOS 24:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 24:8">Egz 24:8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Josué te fè yon akò avèk pèp la nan jou sa a. Li te fè pou yo yon lwa ak yon règleman nan Sichem. <verse eid="JOS 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOS 24:26"/>Josué te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:24">Det 31:24</ref></char></note>ekri pawòl sila yo nan liv lalwa Bondye a; epi li te pran yon gwo wòch e te fè l kanpe la anba gwo bwadchenn ki te akote sanktyè SENYÈ a. <verse eid="JOS 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOS 24:27"/>Josué te di a tout pèp la: “Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:27-34">Jos 22:27-34</ref></char></note>wòch sa a va tankou yon temwen kont nou; paske li te tande tout pawòl SENYÈ a te pale nou yo. Konsa, li va tankou yon temwen kont nou, pou nou pa vin enfidèl anvè Bondye nou an.” <verse eid="JOS 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOS 24:28"/>Konsa, Josué te voye tout pèp la ale. Yo chak rive nan pwòp eritaj pa yo.<verse eid="JOS 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOS 24:29"/>Li te vin rive apre bagay sa yo ke Josué, fis a Nun nan, sèvitè Bondye a, te vin mouri, avèk laj san-dis ane. <verse eid="JOS 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOS 24:30"/>Yo te antere li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:50">Jos 19:50</ref></char></note>nan teritwa eritaj li nan Thimnath-Sérach, ki nan peyi ti mòn Éphraïm yo, sou nò a mòn Gaasch. <verse eid="JOS 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOS 24:31"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:6">Jij 2:6</ref></char></note>Israël te sèvi SENYÈ a pandan tout jou a Josué yo, tout jou a ansyen ki te vivan nan tan Josué yo, e yo te konnen tout zèv SENYÈ a te fè pou Israël.<verse eid="JOS 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOS 24:32"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 50:24-25">Jen 50:24-25</ref></char></note>yo te antere zo Joseph yo, ke fis Israël yo te mennen monte soti Égypte, nan Sichem, nan mòso tè ke Jacob te achte nan men fis a Hamor yo, papa a Sichem, pou san pyès lajan an. Konsa, yo te devni eritaj a fis Joseph yo. <verse eid="JOS 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOS 24:33"/>Anplis, Éléazar, fis a Aaron an te vin mouri. Yo te antere li nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 22:13">Jos 22:13</ref></char></note>Guibeath-Phinées, ki te bay a fis li nan peyi ti kolin a Éphraïm yo.<verse eid="JOS 24:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JOS 24"/>
</usx>
